inder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-28T13:17:37-07:00","id":1108909,"title":"","content":"If full month KS, then it will perfectly lending for my birthday. Hope I will have funds then, as lately it's more like 'will I eat today or fund this hobby book'... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-28T14:24:55-07:00","id":1108935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1108150#post1108150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dark Eras 2 Kickstarter goes live next Thursday (the 6th) at Noon ET!</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice, I didn't expect it to be so soon. But I imagine they didn't finish the main manuscript this time.<br /> <br /> Really curious to see the starting Dark Eras. I'm already playing three so far, but I hope to play a lot more soon. And knowing before hand the other eras will help me plan cameos and connections. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-28T14:33:38-07:00","id":1108945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Max Deltree</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1108935#post1108935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nice, I didn't expect it to be so soon. But I imagine they didn't finish the main manuscript this time.<br /> <br /> Really curious to see the starting Dark Eras. I'm already playing three so far, but I hope to play a lot more soon. And knowing before hand the other eras will help me plan cameos and connections. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm really wonder if we are going to vote on every single era this time since there most certainly has not been time for a manuscript to be written. Super hyped for this one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T19:51:56-07:00","id":1110017,"title":"","content":"We have new details people!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rich, via Kickstarter</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">We're going to start with 6 Dark Eras that have the denizens of two game lines each in them, so all your favorite <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> game lines will be represented.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">From there, we'll be giving you the chance to vote on which Dark Eras make it into the book as Stretch Goals, and sometimes we're planning on switching things up, like presenting you with an Era but you vote on the game line(s) that goes with it. Or starting with us giving you the game line(s), but you vote on an Era. Things like that.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">We have 6 slots for added Dark Eras and once we hit those, and essentially double the size of the book, we'll be going right into the creation of a <b>Dark Eras 2 Companion</b> book with room for a bunch more Dark Eras.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In an effort to avoid some of the congestion and roadblocks that slowed down the creation of the original <b>Dark Eras</b> book, we're starting this Kickstarter before we have anything written. Our three, count 'em three, developers, Monica Valentinelli, Matthew Dawkins, and Meghan Fitzgerald, have writers ready to start on the initial six Eras as soon as we finish the KS, and more lined up to take on any additional Eras we unlock.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">That way, any added bits to any of the chapters don't have to be shoe-horned in, but can be planned for and organically fit into the writing that will happen after the KS dust settles. After the original<b> Dark Eras</b> KS, we really think this method will result in a much faster writing and art direction cycle.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hope to see ya there!</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Any guesses on the pairs and initial eras?<br /> <br /> <b>EDIT</b>: So there are ten gamelines, but eleven if you include Deviant. Are we going to see an era with the Remade? Who's going to get the extra crossover? Beast maybe, since it is crossover friendly and missed the first Kickstarter and only made it in due to popular demand in its own Kickstarter? Or - could we see one of the Eras be a crossover with something like Innocents or Inferno?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 06-30-2017, 10:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T20:13:34-07:00","id":1110026,"title":"","content":"I'm leaning towards the 12th gameline being one of the blue book splats. <br /> <br /> Either way, base book having 6 eras and all being dual-gamelines? Neat-o.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T20:14:30-07:00","id":1110027,"title":"","content":"The games that are still left behind in 1e make me really nervous about this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T20:20:41-07:00","id":1110029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110026#post1110026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm leaning towards the 12th gameline being one of the blue book splats. <br /> <br /> Either way, base book having 6 eras and all being dual-gamelines? Neat-o.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that's a neat idea, especially if they interact, and it should get us to voting part faster. <br /> <br /> Here were my initial Crossover pitches: <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>me</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Crossovers (in general, I want to see splats in crossovers actually interact, like in Mutapa and Black Death in the Companion)<br /> -Divine Comedy Geist/Promethean - Realistically Dante's Florence could host any and all game lines. I think Geist and Promethean are the closest two thematically because the Comedia keys in on the themes of Second Chances and Pilgrimage. While others may suggest focusing on Inferno (both the opening book of the Comedy and the CofD supplement) Dante is at his best if you look at all three parts of the Comedy as a whole work.<br /> -Etruscan Vampire/Mummy - Pre-Roman Vampire would be interesting, and the Etruscans practically invented Necropolises which is interesting for both Mummies and Nosferatu <br /> -Jacobite Risings Changeling/Demon - specifically on the Isle of Skye, where there are folk tales of fairies who are fallen angels. <br /> -Arthurian Mage/Changeling - Dave knows. And he knows we have. Mighty need for it. <br /> -Industrial Revolution Demon/Mummy - The God-Machine take advantage of human ingenuity while the Arisen rise to find a world that starts to resemble the one they lost lifetimes ago.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really want to see Mage/Changeling Camelot happen, but I also think that it would be neat as Mage/Beast, and I really want Mage/Mummy French Revolution to happen. Maybe Mage/Changeling Camelot and French Revolution Mummy/Beast?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T20:45:20-07:00","id":1110034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110029#post1110029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, that's a neat idea, especially if they interact, and it should get us to voting part faster. <br /> <br /> Here were my initial Crossover pitches: <br /> <br /> <br /> I really want to see Mage/Changeling Camelot happen, but I also think that it would be neat as Mage/Beast, and I really want Mage/Mummy French Revolution to happen. Maybe Mage/Changeling Camelot and French Revolution Mummy/Beast?</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel the need to bring back my Beast/Changeling Mythic Greece idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T21:04:40-07:00","id":1110039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110034#post1110034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I feel the need to bring back my Beas