g>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110039#post1110039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Promethean/Beast Mythic Greece and/or Homeric Greece would also be cool if they centered around Odysseus and Homer respectively.</div> </div> </div> </div>My particular angle on it is &quot;Begotten as wannabe Furies unsure how to reconcile their fraudulent define purpose with the Lost who have clearly been touched by the gods for real,&quot; with a dash of Echidna-as-Dark-Mother.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T21:15:53-07:00","id":1110049,"title":"","content":"I still wanna see a Beast/Inferno Satanic Panic (80s/90s United States).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T21:21:26-07:00","id":1110051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110049#post1110049\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still wanna see a Beast/Inferno Satanic Panic (80s/90s United States).</div> </div> </div> </div>I was litterally coming here to quote you on that one! I also liked your Beast/Hunter Mythic Greece idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T22:08:49-07:00","id":1110059,"title":"","content":"French Revolution should be Mage/Beast and Caribbean in Golden Age of Piracy should be Beast/Geist. ( But we need somehow to see Mage in Pirates also, somehow... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) And that's why we need those...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.insidethemagic.net/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/DavyJones.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.cosmicbooknews.com/sites/default/files/pirates-javier-bardem.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> And we need Age of ( Britain ) Anarchy Mage / Changeling ( As direct Arthurian is not very possible ) . We then go Bronze Age Collapse - with everything, I guess - and I'm content. OR we will got Baptism of Poland for Werewolf/Changeling. And then I die happy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-01-2017, 01:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T22:20:50-07:00","id":1110061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110059#post1110059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">French Revolution should be Mage/Beast and Caribbean in Golden Age of Piracy should be Beast/Geist. </div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, first off, those all sound like awesome. Second off, if we get French Revolution, I really hope someone expands it with 10k words to include Mage/Mummy/Beast, because that's an important era for all three. <br /> <br /> With that said, French Revolution needs to be Mummy. The French Revolution change modern history in such a complete way that you may as well say it broke history. Even setting aside just how much that sounds like the Rite of Return, the Revolution was all to likely the first time the Arisen stood up and said &quot;Fuck the Judges!&quot; We need to see that moment!<br /> <br /> Also, the Golden Age of Piracy is called out as a notable time period in Mage 2e, so I'd prefer to see that over Beast.<br /> <br /> I vote Mummy/Beast French Revolution and Mage/Geist Golden Age of Piracy if those are two of the six. With all due respect. I have strong opinions on those two.<br /> <br /> It also just occurred to me that Werewolf/Geist Wild West would be sick!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T22:50:57-07:00","id":1110063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110061#post1110061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, first off, those all sound like awesome. Second off, if we get French Revolution, I really hope someone expands it with 10k words to include Mage/Mummy/Beast, because that's an important era for all three.<br /> <br /> With that said, French Revolution needs to be Mummy. The French Revolution change modern history in such a complete way that you may as well say it broke history. Even setting aside just how much that sounds like the Rite of Return, the Revolution was all to likely the first time the Arisen stood up and said &quot;Fuck the Judges!&quot; We need to see that moment!</div> </div> </div> </div>And for me using Mummy in this important setting as French Revolution is a waste - I do not use Mummy in my games ( like at <i>all</i> ), but French Revolution is ground breaking period for Mage - start of Nameless War, clash of various forms of tyranny ( old vs new Seers of Throne reform ). On Beast front - times of literal Reign of Terror/Horror is perfect fit and allegory for Begotten condition. All I could see Mummy is chosen over is that in Bonaparte times ( that are few years after proper Revolution ), Egyptology is on rise - that's all. There is nothing truly Mummy specific in this time period, it would only be setting lore stuff.<br /> <br /> If we get Mage\\Mummy I will ended the same disappointed like with <i>Princes of Conquared Lands</i> ( Mutapa Empire ) - half of Era's text will be not used by me. AND we lose prefect Era for Beast.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110061#post1110061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, the Golden Age of Piracy is called out as a notable time period in Mage 2e, so I'd prefer to see that over Beast.</div> </div> </div> </div>On this I can agree, as reasoning is sound on any of Mage, Beast and Geist with Piracy. If we will have Beast Satanic Panic and French Revolution, I can be content with Mage\\Geist in Piracy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110061#post1110061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I vote Mummy/Beast French Revolution and Mage/Geist Golden Age of Piracy if those are two of the six. With all due respect. I have strong opinions on those two.</div> </div> </div> </div>So do I on French Mage\\Beast and Mage\\Beast Piracy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <b>Best would be to make those triple Era ( Mage\\Beast\\Mummy and Mage\\Beast\\Geist, respectively ) but will be content with Mage\\Geist on Pirates, if we get Beast in Revolution France.</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110061#post1110061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It also just occurred to me that Werewolf/Geist Wild West would be sick!</div> </div> </div> </div>On this, I agree! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-01-2017, 02:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T22:56:07-07:00","id":1110065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110063#post1110063\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And for me using Mummy in this important setting as French Revolution is a waste - I do not use Mummy in my games ( like at <i>all</i> ), but French Revolution is ground breaking period for Mage - start of Nameless War, clash of various forms of tyranny ( old vs new Seers of Throne reform ). On Beast front - times of literal Reign of Terror/Horror is perfect fit and allegory for Begotten condition. All I could see Mummy is chosen over is that in Bonaparte times ( that are few years after proper Revolution ), Egyptology is on rise - that's all.</div> </div> </div> </div>The French Revolution was a ready fit for Mummy because it would terrify the Arisen with the threat of their own servants breaking the natural order and rising up to overthrow them even as it inspires them to likewise rise against their distant masters; it's a solid parallel for the core thematic conflict of the entire gameline. If you don't like Mummy, that's fine, but don't call something that suits it incredibly well a waste just because you aren't familiar with it.<br /> <br /> Also, don't get mad about a setting being &quot;wasted&quot; when that setting doesn't exist beyond a single sentence pitch that wound up not getting chosen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T23:03:23-07:00","id":1110068,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110051#post1110051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was litterally coming here to quote you on that one! I also liked your Beast/Hunter Mythic Greece idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, Beast Satanic panic was my idea, Malonkey just added Inferno (which I fully approve of, thank you Malonkey).<br /> <br /> I originally wanted hunter to be paired with Beast for satanic panic, but then I remembered that the 80s was also the golden age of slashers.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T23:10:25-07:00","id":1110069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110065#post1110065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, don't get mad about a setting being &quot;wasted&quot; when that setting doesn't exist beyond a single sentence pitch that wound up not getting chosen.</div> </div> </div> </div>If we get Mage\\Mummy French Revolution, then there is really not being possible to see Beast French Revolution, as OPP do not return with material to their previous written Dark Eras.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T23:15:28-07:00","id":1110071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110069#post1110069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If we get Mage\\Mummy French Revolution, then there is really not being possible to see Beast French Revolution, as OPP do not return with material to their previous written Dark Eras.</div> </div> </div> </div>And why is your desire for Beast content more worthwhile than anyone else wanting Mummy content? I personally think the Beast connection is far more tenuous.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T23:18:41-07:00","id":1110072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110069#post1110069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If we get Mage\\Mummy French Revolution, then there is really not being possible to see Beast French Revolution, as OPP do not return with material to their previous written Dark Eras.</div> </div> </div> </div>Based on what? All three of the mini-Eras in War Against the Pure (Yellow Turban China, Roman-Parthian War, and Icelandic Settlement) were either featured again (The Wolf and The Raven) or had an era set a few decades before (Forsaken by Roman) or after (Three Kingdoms of Darkness). Hell, the biggest historical setting bar none is Requiem for Rome, and it got not one but two Eras for other gamelines in the DEC. Even the appendix of RfR, Slouching Towards Byzantium, got a semi-sequel in Sothis Ascends (Return to Dust). I'd say there is plenty of evidence that if a setting is compelling, OPP will revisit it, just not in the same Kickstarter and probably not right away.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T23:50:54-07:00","id":1110080,"title":"","content":"In that case I'd very much like to see VtR in ancient Egypt either during or shortly after the reign of Ramesses II (which saw the formation of the Great Covenant), or during the Christianization of Egypt (which saw the dissolution of the Great Covenant).<br /> It's described in Ancient Mysteries, but nothing is explained in a way that allows you to use that setting in a game. How was unlife in the Great Covenant? What did the different Cults actually do? What was the Bak-Ra like during their height of power? What was the Cult of Set like before they warped into the Followers of Set? None of it's actually explained.<br /> I really do like that fluff, but none of it particularly useable. A revisiting in the form of Dark Eras would've been perfect for those of us who'd like to actually play that setting.<br /> And while you're at it (if that Era would come to pass) you could include a write-up for the Anubi bloodline that got teased to hell and back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":11887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","user":"Tessie","date":". 07-01-2017, 03:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T01:13:08-07:00","id":1110092,"title":"","content":"well, time to get a new debit card! Dark Eras 2- come at me!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T01:47:39-07:00","id":1110097,"title":"","content":"Gotta say Mage/Mummy feels better for French Revolution. I actually suggested a &quot;Napoleonic Mummy&quot; (not necessarily set in Egypt, where legend says Napoleon had a weird trip at the pyramids, but rather in Europe.)<br /> <br /> Dunno, but the whole &quot;French Revolution/Napoleonic Era&quot; has a combination of themes and aesthetics that I feel really work well with Mummy. Also agreeing with Ancient Egypt Vampire. My personal suggestion for Vampire was Roaring Twenties (I want vampiric flappers and Gatsby's expies that suck blood), but if Egypt happens, I'll be ok with it.<br /> <br /> As for pirates, that Era was so popular I'm sure we're gonna see it in a shape or the other","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 07-01-2017, 04:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T07:53:45-07:00","id":1110163,"title":"","content":"I'm definitely holding out for a Golden Age of Piracy Geist &amp; Beast/Mage and/or Wild West Geist &amp; Werewolf. They would be plenty fun eras.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T09:22:32-07:00","id":1110226,"title":"","content":"Okay, here's my stab at the six Eras:<br /> <br /> Vampire/Mummy Etruscans<br /> Hunter/Demon Book of Judges<br /> Mage/Changeling Roman Arthurian Britannia <br /> Werewolf/Geist Wild West<br /> Promethean/Deviant Nuclear Arms Race<br /> Beast/Inferno Satanic Panic<br /> <br /> It's probably wrong, since it's based around my bias for the Vampire/Mummy era, which was my suggestion but I think that was a neat idea and some other people seemed to like it, so who knows. The others just seem logical, The Blackhatted One has said he liked the Satanic Panic idea, Dave knows how much people love the Arthur idea and it almost was the initial Mage Era for DE1. Most people want Book of Judges Hunter and Demon pairs with that perfectly. Promethean has always cared about nuclear power, while Deviant cites Akira as a major influence, plus they are an interesting contrast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T09:32:56-07:00","id":1110230,"title":"","content":"While they have done eras, or at least near eras, that they've done in the past, I'm unsure whether they'll do something that is still a classic World of Darkness line. Considering White Wolf's attempts to resurrect the games and their ability to say no, we might not get a Wild West Werewolf, as it's something they already have in Apocalypse. It will be interesting to see if it pops up.<br /> <br /> Frankly the Golden Age of Piracy has always seemed more like a werewolf era anyways. The time for mage looks to be more focused on what happened in Nassau than piracy in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 07-01-2017, 12:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T09:41:22-07:00","id":1110232,"title":"","content":"If we get a Pirate Era and Black Sails is not listed in the inspirations, I'm gonna riot. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T12:24:46-07:00","id":1110297,"title":"","content":"Pirate setting absolutely needs to be Geist. I could see a strong argument for Geist/Mage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T12:56:52-07:00","id":1110311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110297#post1110297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pirate setting absolutely needs to be Geist. I could see a strong argument for Geist/Mage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maritime folklore is one of those things I'm really into and given how much of it is about ghosts, I agree. But I do also agree with Nofather about it having potential for Werewolf, tons of it. The combo I hope for is Geist/Werewolf.<br /> <br /> Here's the list of my proposals made after the first Kickstarter. I hope for all of them, clearly, but the bold ones are the one I sincerely believe might happen. I'm ok with hearing your thoughts about it, since I'll probably fight for at least some of these during the upcoming Kickstarter. There are ideas out there I think to be better than mine and that I've embraced since I saw them, but here's what I proposed in the first place.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Roaring Twenties Vampire</b> </span></span></span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Golden Age of Piracy Werewolf/Geist </span></span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">North American Fur Trade Werewolf </span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Space Race Era Mage </span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Wild West Promethean </span></span></span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Atomic Age Promethean/Demon </span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Islamic Golden Age Changeling/Mummy </span></span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Italian Age of Revolutions Hunter/Mummy </span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Third Punic War Geist </span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Napoleonic Mummy </span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Classical Greece Beast </span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">18th Century Whaling Era Beast (yeah, shamelessly talking about Moby Dick) </span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Arthurian England Mage<br /> Birth of Psychoanalysis </span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Beast (Freud, Jung and dreams)</span></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T13:02:13-07:00","id":1110312,"title":"","content":"I mentioned this on the Kickstarter before, but I really want a Vampire setting in one of the kingdoms in Muslim Iberia; I think it would be a lovely look at the game's heady political play outside of a classical European Christian setup.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T14:04:07-07:00","id":1110346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110312#post1110312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mentioned this on the Kickstarter before, but I really want a Vampire setting in one of the kingdoms in Muslim Iberia; I think it would be a lovely look at the game's heady political play outside of a classical European Christian setup.</div> </div> </div> </div>Imwas actually thinking about this the other day and how perfect a post-Umayyad Iberia is for Vampire. Maybe pair it with Changeling?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T15:06:11-07:00","id":1110386,"title":"","content":"I'd really like to see a Golden Age of Piracy setting for Mage/???, specifically to see exactly just what caused the Silver Ladder and Seers of the Throne to team up. Because damn, that is nearly unprecedented. (Save the crusades...actually Mage/??? During the crusades would be amazing too.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T15:32:34-07:00","id":1110391,"title":"","content":"Reconstruction American South or Cultural Revolution China for Vampire.<br /> <br /> Cold War Poland or the Troubles Ireland for Werewolf. <br /> <br /> Meiji Restoration or Norman Conquest for Mage. <br /> <br /> Gold Rush or Apartheid for Promethean. <br /> <br /> Roaring 20s for Demon. <br /> <br /> Showa Period for Beast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T15:45:30-07:00","id":1110395,"title":"","content":"I'd love to see more Vampire settings this go around. We got these fancy elders and now we just need more places to play them in!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T19:53:48-07:00","id":1110449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haberdasher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110391#post1110391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cold War Poland or the Troubles Ireland for Werewolf.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6498_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6498\" data-vbnamecard=\"6498\">Haberdasher</a>, I'm really confused why do you equal Cold War in Poland with Werewolf - as Polish guy, I really cannot see <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_People%27s_Republic\" target=\"_blank\">PRL times</a> as something you 'hunt for' then. Maybe for next standing in lines for food or clothes or on the Church mass as well resistance rallys, but this does not sound as very RPG good setting to me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Polish people resistance against Soviets was not blowing up cars or hunting Party higher-ups \u2013 it was much more peaceful revolution of demonstrations, strikes and at worst, martial law at peak of social discontent. In many ways it looked like Human Rights Movement fight on the West. And our local Catholic Church was more than resisting element \u2013 religion was <i>heart </i>of opposition. ( That\u2019s now is biting us in our asses, as Church being so important to opposition in PRL means it dictates now lives of Polish people in country \u2013 so LGBT+ people, like me, have very hard under it\u2019s \u2018rule of souls\u2019 in modern Poland. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> On the other hand, we had long local fandom idea for the 'Iron Curtain' settings in Poland at that time for ( then ) nWoD - let me remember them and maybe add few more...<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i><b>'Iron Curtain' Eras ideas</b></i></span><br /> <b>Vampire</b> - Undead are capitalist subvertists, drinking from workers population of new state. In reality, some of Party's higher-ups are wanting to become immortal. Invictus if fighting to sustain it\u2019s assets, were Carthian Movement say \u2018We are voice of people!\u2019 and Lancea et Sanctum is helping resistance in 'Showing those atheist wrath of one true God \u2013 and the Hell waiting for them!\u2019<br /> <br /> <b>Werewolf</b> - I really have problem how to marriage animism and Sacred Hunt in this time period, even if I really would want.<br /> <br /> <b>Mage</b> \u2013 Seers of Throne are on the high tide in totalitarian regimes \u2013 they always were. But Diamond Orders rebellion is on the rise in Poland, pulling strings in resistance. Even if some Awakened have sell out to Party. ( Real world facts \u2013 there are some evident that our own \u2018occultists\u2019 were very interested in fighting regime. Real world Mason Lodges helped opposition in PRL times. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> <b>Promethean</b> \u2013 Soviets made many strange experiments \u2013 Zeka Linage being only one of them. Also times of hard lives under communist rules made many people to pilgrimage for work and life sense.<br /> <br /> <b>Changeling</b> \u2013 Like my buddy summed up it before \u2018Fairy tale about tractor and harvester\u2019 <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Hunter</b> \u2013 See Promethean on monsters. On the other hand, many layers of Soviets secret service and fight with resistance can also make nice story twists.<br /> <br /> <b>Geist</b> \u2013 Party\u2019s regime have started with much blood on it\u2019s hands. Now the dead want the revenge for crimes of the past.<br /> <br /> <b>Mummy</b> \u2013 Do not know line, but it probably would have problem to jive with Iron Curtain countries.<br /> <br /> <b>Demon</b> \u2013 We had Russian Revolution Era in <b>Dark Eras Companion</b> book.<br /> <br /> <b>Beast</b> \u2013 Great ways to explore this Era, I think. Beasts are about moral lessons what people SHOULD NOT do to another \u2013 and communists society were full of people like that. On the other hand, interesting would be some kind organization of Beasts that say \u2018No, we will be better than those true monsters \u2013 Soviets\u2019. Showing that people are worse monsters than real world monsters.<br /> <br /> <b>Deviant</b> - See Promethean and Hunter sections.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-02-2017, 03:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T21:46:20-07:00","id":1110464,"title":"","content":"Alright, I had a few eras I'd like to see, in no particular order or organization:<ul><li>Satanic Panic (Beast/Inferno/Possibly Hunter): It's the 80s. It's a pretty sweet decade, except for one problem. A woman's repressed memories of a horrible ritual, presided over by a monster-man in a blood-red robe, came to her in a dream. Actually, there <i>were</i> not memories, and it was just a dream, but people lost their shit anyway. Thanks to that one cavalier beast, and the urging of some Heroes, has made this time one of the most dangerous times in human history for the Begotten, simultaneously turning eyes away from the real monsters on Wall street, ranging from mundane greedy assholes feeding lesser Demons, to full-on cults devoted to greed and avarice.</li> <li>Book of Exodus (Demon/Promethean): God's children wander Deshret, seeking their promised land, not knowing that demons and monsters walk among them. And they're the ones keeping them alive. Moses hears His word, and while it's usually right, revelead to him by glorious angels of fire and lightning, other times, other angels of metal and cold calculation whisper to him. The Demons, who would later teach Solomon, subvert the false Angels that would lead the tribe of Israel astray, and those ancient Golmim formed of the dead receive missions to protect His favored people. Can they reach the Promised Land? And which Angels first spoke to Moses of it?</li> <li>Post-WWII USA (Mage/Hunter): The War's over, and America's full of piss and vinegar. The economy's booming, and soldiers have come home to start families and return to civilian society. Some people aren't so entertained with the domestic life anymore, though, and have taken a page <sup>(I'm not sorry)</sup> from the superhero comics they read on the front, taking to the shadows to fight evil. The Free Council is experiencing an unprecedented boom, making the Diamond and Seers both nervous, as Hunter Compacts and Conspiracies grow to record sizes. It's a damn good time to be a human being in America. Unless you're black. Or a woman. Or gay. Or you just happen to not have a soul, or have a ghost in you, or something. If you've read Watchmen, you kind of have the basic idea of this era.</li> <li>Warring States Japan (Werewolf/Geist): The islands of Japan are in a state of war, and the Shadow has been thrown into a similar uproar, and war-spirits and their entourages grow fat and powerful. The Bone Shadows demand that the Uratha remain occupied with the state of the Shadow, while the Iron Masters claim the only wqay to quell the Shadow is to end the fighting. And if an Uratha is left as the Shogun, all the better. What neither party realizes is that the dead have a stake in this fight. The spirits of ancestors and the hungry ghosts of fallen warriors have been manipulating the wars, either to further their living kin's agendas, or to take revenge upon their killers. Those touched by death are at their limit already, but the realm of the dead seems to becoming over-full, threatening man, wolf, and everything in between.</li> <li>I can't think of a specific era, but I want to see Changeling/Mummy something. They have Fate at their core, but they have wildly differing conceptions of Fate, it'd be neat to see those juxtaposed. Plus, I just wanna see some Huntsmen and/or Charlatans get fucked right up by a Mummy. Hell, there might even be a combination Freehold/Mummy Cult with a Bulwark built around the Mummy's Descent.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":4488,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","user":"malonkey1","date":". 07-02-2017, 12:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T22:00:05-07:00","id":1110468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110464#post1110464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, I had a few eras I'd like to see, in no particular order or organization:<ul><li>Satanic Panic (Beast/Inferno/Possibly Hunter): It's the 80s. It's a pretty sweet decade, except for one problem. A woman's repressed memories of a horrible ritual, presided over by a monster-man in a blood-red robe, came to her in a dream. Actually, there <i>were</i> not memories, and it was just a dream, but people lost their shit anyway. Thanks to that one cavalier beast, and the urging of some Heroes, has made this time one of the most dangerous times in human history for the Begotten, simultaneously turning eyes away from the real monsters on Wall street, ranging from mundane greedy assholes feeding lesser Demons, to full-on cults devoted to greed and avarice.</li> <li>Book of Exodus (Demon/Promethean): God's children wander Deshret, seeking their promised land, not knowing that demons and monsters walk among them. And they're the ones keeping them alive. Moses hears His word, and while it's usually right, revelead to him by glorious angels of fire and lightning, other times, other angels of metal and cold calculation whisper to him. The Demons, who would later teach Solomon, subvert the false Angels that would lead the tribe of Israel astray, and those ancient Golmim formed of the dead receive missions to protect His favored people. Can they reach the Promised Land? And which Angels first spoke to Moses of it?</li> <li>Post-WWII USA (Mage/Hunter): The War's over, and America's full of piss and vinegar. The economy's booming, and soldiers have come home to start families and return to civilian society. Some people aren't so entertained with the domestic life anymore, though, and have taken a page <sup>(I'm not sorry)</sup> from the superhero comics they read on the front, taking to the shadows to fight evil. The Free Council is experiencing an unprecedented boom, making the Diamond and Seers both nervous, as Hunter Compacts and Conspiracies grow to record sizes. It's a damn good time to be a human being in America. Unless you're black. Or a woman. Or gay. Or you just happen to not have a soul, or have a ghost in you, or something. If you've read Watchmen, you kind of have the basic idea of this era.</li> <li>Warring States Japan (Werewolf/Geist): The islands of Japan are in a state of war, and the Shadow has been thrown into a similar uproar, and war-spirits and their entourages grow fat and powerful. The Bone Shadows demand that the Uratha remain occupied with the state of the Shadow, while the Iron Masters claim the only wqay to quell the Shadow is to end the fighting. And if an Uratha is left as the Shogun, all the better. What neither party realizes is that the dead have a stake in this fight. The spirits of ancestors and the hungry ghosts of fallen warriors have been manipulating the wars, either to further their living kin's agendas, or to take revenge upon their killers. Those touched by death are at their limit already, but the realm of the dead seems to becoming over-full, threatening man, wolf, and everything in between.</li> <li>I can't think of a specific era, but I want to see Changeling/Mummy something. They have Fate at their core, but they have wildly differing conceptions of Fate, it'd be neat to see those juxtaposed. Plus, I just wanna see some Huntsmen and/or Charlatans get fucked right up by a Mummy. Hell, there might even be a combination Freehold/Mummy Cult with a Bulwark built around the Mummy's Descent.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Some suggestions for Changeling/Mummy:<br /> - Islamic Golden Age<br /> - Delhi Sultantate <br /> - Mongol Empire or the Golden Horde<br /> - Creation of Le Morte de Arthur<br /> - Modernization of Dubai<br /> - Napoleon III's Remodeling of Paris","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T22:02:29-07:00","id":1110469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110464#post1110464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, I had a few eras I'd like to see, in no particular order or organization:<ul><li>Satanic Panic (Beast/Inferno/Possibly Hunter): It's the 80s. It's a pretty sweet decade, except for one problem. A woman's repressed memories of a horrible ritual, presided over by a monster-man in a blood-red robe, came to her in a dream. Actually, there <i>were</i> not memories, and it was just a dream, but people lost their shit anyway. Thanks to that one cavalier beast, and the urging of some Heroes, has made this time one of the most dangerous times in human history for the Begotten, simultaneously turning eyes away from the real monsters on Wall street, ranging from mundane greedy assholes feeding lesser Demons, to full-on cults devoted to greed and avarice.</li> </ul><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>This is pretty much what I was thinking. Good job. Also, the corrupt psychologists and fame seeking prosecutors are probably heroes. Don't forget the talk show hosts and well intentioned 2nd wave feminist activists relying on bad science that egged it on either, the panic may have mostly benefited the religious right, but they weren't the only ones fanning the flames.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T22:45:44-07:00","id":1110479,"title":"","content":"Does anyone remember my old Meiji Werewolf pitch? I need to dig it up but don't have the spoons right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T02:22:28-07:00","id":1110499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110449#post1110449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Werewolf</b> - I really have problem how to marriage animism and Sacred Hunt in this time period, even if I really would want.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not Poland <i>per se</i>, but Werewolf set in the Siberian gulag could have promise.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T05:08:21-07:00","id":1110516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110479#post1110479\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone remember my old Meiji Werewolf pitch? I need to dig it up but don't have the spoons right now.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/433319-elevator-pitch-a-dark-era?p=433409#post433409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Meiji Werewolf (1890s Japan - W:tF)<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;Picture Seven Samurai, but with werewolves.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Meiji Restoration, Japan (1890s Japan): The extinction of the Japanese Wolf coincides with the end of the samurai as massive reforms in the government and military forcibly bring Japan into the modern era. Western ideas and technology bring new spirits that clash with those old kami used to generations of appeasement, and the Forsaken find themselves struggling to balance tradition with the inevitable march of progress. It is clear that Japan cannot exist as it once did in this new age, and that sentiment hits hard for the heirs of Father Wolf's murderers. Can tooth and claw stand before ranks of foreign rifles? <br /> <br /> (The clash of two worlds that, ultimately, cannot coexist; the death of traditions that can\u2019t survive as a metaphor for Father Wolf\u2019s murder).<br /> <br /> tl;dr Forsaken as ronin in a time of profound spiritual upheavel as Japan is dragged into the modern era by foreigners.</div> </div> </div> </div>Characters","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T05:26:09-07:00","id":1110519,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110449#post1110449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6498_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6498\" data-vbnamecard=\"6498\">Haberdasher</a>, I'm really confused why do you equal Cold War in Poland with Werewolf - as Polish guy, I really cannot see <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_People%27s_Republic\" target=\"_blank\">PRL times</a> as something you 'hunt for' then. Maybe for next standing in lines for food or clothes or on the Church mass as well resistance rallys, but this does not sound as very RPG good setting to me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Polish people resistance against Soviets was not blowing up cars or hunting Party higher-ups \u2013 it was much more peaceful revolution of demonstrations, strikes and at worst, martial law at peak of social discontent. In many ways it looked like Human Rights Movement fight on the West. And our local Catholic Church was more than resisting element \u2013 religion was <i>heart </i>of opposition. ( That\u2019s now is biting us in our asses, as Church being so important to opposition in PRL means it dictates now lives of Polish people in country \u2013 so LGBT+ people, like me, have very hard under it\u2019s \u2018rule of souls\u2019 in modern Poland. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't mean to cause offense, so if I did, I'm sorry. I certainly wasn't trying to suggest that Polish resistance to the Soviets and the activities of the IRA during the Troubles were similar. I know a little bit about the history of each, and I know that Polish resistance was largely peaceful. <br /> <br /> When I said &quot;Cold War Poland,&quot; I was specifically thinking using the first few years after the end of WWII. I'm sure I don't have to remind you how awful things were in Poland during and immediately after WWII. So I figure that there would probably be a lot of spiritual chaos in the Polish Shadow: death spirits, violence spirits, fear spirits, anger spirits. And I just thought reading about how the Polish Forsaken handled that situation would be an interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T06:43:37-07:00","id":1110527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haberdasher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110519#post1110519\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I didn't mean to cause offense, so if I did, I'm sorry. I certainly wasn't trying to suggest that Polish resistance to the Soviets and the activities of the IRA during the Troubles were similar. I know a little bit about the history of each, and I know that Polish resistance was largely peaceful.<br /> <br /> When I said &quot;Cold War Poland,&quot; I was specifically thinking using the first few years after the end of WWII. I'm sure I don't have to remind you how awful things were in Poland during and immediately after WWII. So I figure that there would probably be a lot of spiritual chaos in the Polish Shadow: death spirits, violence spirits, fear spirits, anger spirits. And I just thought reading about how the Polish Forsaken handled that situation would be an interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Offense do not take - I just wanted to straight things for public forum. And 'Cold War' is VERY LONG historical period description, going over for over 45 years ( 1944-1990 ) for whole world, or at least Iron Curtain countries. What you meant is almost decade ( circa 1944 - 1952 ) of guerrilla fighting between Polish Home Army and Russian Red Army that - in reality - occupied whole country and lead to proper <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_People%27s_Republic\" target=\"_blank\">People Republic of Poland</a> ( i.e. PRL in short in Polish ). It was outlined in <i>Fields of Dogs</i> Hunting Ground in <b>WtF</b> 2E corebook. And yes, <i>this</i> particular decade could work as Werewolf setting, with all the hunting on enemies of Poland and Russia in woods and cities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T19:01:11-07:00","id":1111103,"title":"","content":"Do you think the book will cover NYC from a demon perspective. I think it would be awesome to see NYC during the 1920's. Even the 70's would be awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T19:06:18-07:00","id":1111105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111103#post1111103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you think the book will cover NYC from a demon perspective. I think it would be awesome to see NYC during the 1920's. Even the 70's would be awesome.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't put money on the 70's, since that was Werewolf's era in Dark Eras. 20s would be cool though!<br /> <br /> I was really hoping we'd find out some of the era today in the MM Notes, but alas, no luck. Here's another possible six, although this one I think is less plausible.<br /> <br /> <br /> Vampire/Deviant Balkan Wars of Independence<br /> Werewolf/Hunter WWII Pacific Theatre<br /> Mage/Geist Golden Age of Piracy<br /> Promethean/Mummy Mansa Musa's Hajj<br /> Changeling/Demon Jacobite Scotland<br /> Beast/Innocents Blitz","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T19:44:01-07:00","id":1111118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1110464#post1110464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, I had a few eras I'd like to see, in no particular order or organization:<ul><li>Satanic Panic (Beast/Inferno/Possibly Hunter): It's the 80s. It's a pretty sweet decade, except for one problem. A woman's repressed memories of a horrible ritual, presided over by a monster-man in a blood-red robe, came to her in a dream. Actually, there <i>were</i> not memories, and it was just a dream, but people lost their shit anyway. Thanks to that one cavalier beast, and the urging of some Heroes, has made this time one of the most dangerous times in human history for the Begotten, simultaneously turning eyes away from the real monsters on Wall street, ranging from mundane greedy assholes feeding lesser Demons, to full-on cults devoted to greed and avarice.</li> </ul><br /> </div> </div> </div> </div>The title of this era needs to be &quot;Read me Backwards&quot; after a song Joan Baez wrote about the accusations (she believed them, though said song was from 1992)<br /> <br /> But seriously, Read <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B007YFJQQS/ref=oh_aui_d_detailpage_o00_?ie=UTF8&amp;psc=1\" target=\"_blank\">Satan's Silence </a><br /> <br /> I just bought a copy and it is terrifying how quickly the panic became institutionalized.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 07-03-2017, 10:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T19:44:56-07:00","id":1111119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111105#post1111105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't put money on the 70's, since that was Werewolf's era in Dark Eras. 20s would be cool though!<br /> <br /> I was really hoping we'd find out some of the era today in the MM Notes, but alas, no luck. Here's another possible six, although this one I think is less plausible.</div> </div> </div> </div>While we didn't find out about the eras precisely we did find out about how it's set up.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dark Eras Kickstarter e-mail</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're going to start with 6 Dark Eras that have the denizens of two game lines each in them, so all your favorite Chronicles of Darkness game lines will be represented.<br /> <br /> From there, we'll be giving you the chance to vote on which Dark Eras make it into the book as Stretch Goals, and sometimes we're planning on switching things up, like presenting you with an Era but you vote on the game line(s) that goes with it. Or starting with us giving you the game line(s), but you vote on an Era. Things like that.<br /> <br /> We have 6 slots for added Dark Eras and once we hit those, and essentially double the size of the book, we'll be going right into the creation of a Dark Eras 2 Companion book with room for a bunch more Dark Eras.<br /> <br /> In an effort to avoid some of the congestion and roadblocks that slowed down the creation of the original Dark Eras book, we're starting this Kickstarter before we have anything written. Our three, count 'em three, developers, Monica Valentinelli, Matthew Dawkins, and Meghan Fitzgerald, have writers ready to start on the initial six Eras as soon as we finish the KS, and more lined up to take on any additional Eras we unlock.<br /> <br /> That way, any added bits to any of the chapters don't have to be shoe-horned in, but can be planned for and organically fit into the writing that will happen after the KS dust settles. After the original Dark Eras KS, we really think this method will result in a much faster writing and art direction cycle.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T20:13:10-07:00","id":1111125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111119#post1111119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While we didn't find out about the eras precisely we did find out about how it's set up.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I know, I quoted that exact same block of text a couple pages ago <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm just a greedy, impatient person, who doesn't want to wait until Thursday.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T20:31:01-07:00","id":1111130,"title":"","content":"Oh, hey, I got one: Vampire/Hunter French Revolution. Set it up at first as aristocract Vamps vs. commoner Hunters, then halfway in, tear away the sheets and reveal that there are Hunters and Vampires on both sides, some of whom are deliberately muddling the conflict for their own personal motives. The Vampires are supporting the revolution in a bid to weaken the \u00c9tats-G\u00e9n\u00e9raux, including the First Estate (and thus the Malleus Maleficarum), while simultaneously evading the notice of the legitimate revolutionary Hunters that believe that the Vampires are already in control...Because another set of Vampires actually <i>are</i> in control, to a limited extent. While every part of the conflict has cause to paint it as &quot;noble revolutionaries vs. vile aristocrats&quot; or &quot;filthy commoners overturning society,&quot; in truth it's really just a blood-soaked clusterfuck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T20:52:05-07:00","id":1111134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111130#post1111130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, hey, I got one: Vampire/Hunter French Revolution. Set it up at first as aristocract Vamps vs. commoner Hunters, then halfway in, tear away the sheets and reveal that there are Hunters and Vampires on both sides, some of whom are deliberately muddling the conflict for their own personal motives. The Vampires are supporting the revolution in a bid to weaken the \u00c9tats-G\u00e9n\u00e9raux, including the First Estate (and thus the Malleus Maleficarum), while simultaneously evading the notice of the legitimate revolutionary Hunters that believe that the Vampires are already in control...Because another set of Vampires actually <i>are</i> in control, to a limited extent. While every part of the conflict has cause to paint it as &amp;quot;noble revolutionaries vs. vile aristocrats&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;filthy commoners overturning society,&amp;quot; in truth it's really just a blood-soaked clusterfuck.</div> </div> </div> </div>At this point, I think we need just need Dark Eras: French Revolution Edition as a stretch goal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T21:07:43-07:00","id":1111137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111125#post1111125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know, I quoted that exact same block of text a couple pages ago <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm just a greedy, impatient person, who doesn't want to wait until Thursday.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aw man, I need to start reading my e-mails more. Probably should have checked the thread. The two-gamelines per era should be interesting.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T23:46:23-07:00","id":1111179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111134#post1111134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> At this point, I think we need just need Dark Eras: French Revolution Edition as a stretch goal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, yes, I would totally back this up - we have now like 5 gamelines having strong reasons for the French Revolution Era. I suppose having material for other extra 6 will not be real big problem. In waiting for the Thursday Kickstater, let's play on hammering other 6 Revolution settings ideas. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> We still do not have ideas for those -<br /> <br /> French Revolution:<ul><li>Werewolf</li> <li>Promethean</li> <li>Changeling</li> <li>Geist</li> <li>Demon</li> <li>Deviant</li> </ul>Here is my take on...<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>French Revolution Werewolf</b> - In the light of Reason, people forget about what they were afraid in the dark. Just few decades after <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beast_of_G%C3%A9vaudan\" target=\"_blank\">Beast of G\u00e9vaudan</a> scandal, Uratha of France have much more pressing matters on their minds - Reign of Terror, with mass public executions, is remaking Hisil in to chaos. There are some whispers about cannibalistic cult inside Temples of Reasons ( called Temple of Apollo ) . And Jacobin terror is used by Tribes of Moon for their next Bretheren War over territories and Wolf-Blooded. It's truly drak times to be Forsaken...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-04-2017, 02:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T10:28:37-07:00","id":1111334,"title":"","content":"Still reading Satan's Silence, those corrupt psychologists (definitely Heroes in a Beast Dark Era )were straight up brainwashing kids to make those accusations, and brain-washing the accused into confessing. Scary Shit<br /> <br /> EDIT: OH MY VARIOUS DEITIES! Janet Reno made an accused suspect with diabetes go into Insulin shock to get a confession, definitively Hero behavior.<br /> <br /> EDIT 2: seems the CEO of Jack in the Box was behind the false accusation of Dave Akiki and had financial ties to the prosecutor in that case.... Wouldn't it be something if a Beast was behind the Jack in Box tainted burger thing in the 90s as revenge on the Hero burger CEO Jack Goodall?<br /> <br /> <br /> Seriously, the political corruption in the panic is the best story hook source.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 07-04-2017, 03:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T22:55:49-07:00","id":1111563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111134#post1111134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At this point, I think we need just need Dark Eras: French Revolution Edition as a stretch goal.</div> </div> </div> </div>And this is also why we need French Revolution as Mage\\Beast Dark Era - like in <i>Fearful Lesson</i> from <b>DE Companion</b>, Beast Era let you use crossover section for making this period annotations to ANY monsters gameline. So we get, in the end, 2 main gamelines + 9-10 lesser annotations to rest of gamelines - in the same Era then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T04:00:06-07:00","id":1111603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111134#post1111134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At this point, I think we need just need Dark Eras: French Revolution Edition as a stretch goal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but what about Dark Eras: Neolithic Edition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T05:37:52-07:00","id":1111623,"title":"","content":"no no, what we need is Dark Eras: After the Fall Edition. Seriously.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T06:36:14-07:00","id":1111634,"title":"","content":"Isn't everything After the Fall?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T06:56:19-07:00","id":1111637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111634#post1111634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't everything After the Fall?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you are thinking about the wrong Fall","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T07:34:10-07:00","id":1111650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111637#post1111637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think you are thinking about the wrong Fall</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, When you say &quot;the Fall&quot; in the context of ChroD, people tend to assume you're referring to the Fall from Mage. To which Fall were you referring?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T07:46:55-07:00","id":1111659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111650#post1111650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, When you say &quot;the Fall&quot; in the context of ChroD, people tend to assume you're referring to the Fall from Mage. To which Fall were you referring?</div> </div> </div> </div>Constantinople's? The Dark Era is called &quot;After the Fall&quot;. I've thought it was clear because of the context.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T09:45:01-07:00","id":1111685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111659#post1111659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Constantinople's? The Dark Era is called &quot;After the Fall&quot;. I've thought it was clear because of the context.</div> </div> </div> </div>While the capital F 'Fall' did make me think Mage's Fall, as evidenced by my post, when you suggested I had the wrong idea I thought about other posts and then guessed you meant Rome, as we've had many Rome-oriented eras and a lot of people seem to want Rome to pop up for their favorite splat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T09:57:39-07:00","id":1111693,"title":"","content":"Interesting that the 24 hour warning says that Dark Eras 2 will be 2e compatible. Is that a sign that they anticipate all of the gamelines will be 2e by the time the Kickstarter is fulfilled? A possible harbinger of Mummy 2e beign announced at GenCon? Or will Geist, Hunter, and Mummy get 2e hacks in the introduction much like those that were in Beast's Core?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T10:09:48-07:00","id":1111695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111693#post1111693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interesting that the 24 hour warning says that Dark Eras 2 will be 2e compatible. Is that a sign that they anticipate all of the gamelines will be 2e by the time the Kickstarter is fulfilled? A possible harbinger of Mummy 2e beign announced at GenCon? Or will Geist, Hunter, and Mummy get 2e hacks in the introduction much like those that were in Beast's Core?</div> </div> </div> </div>The term compatible makes me think that eras dealing with gamelines that don't have second edition rulesets will be more loose in regards to offering mechanics, offering more of a setting than powers or Merits or whatever. Of course, Changeling, Hunter, and Geist are probably far enough along that they can have mechanics for them.<br /> <br /> Think it's been pretty obvious Mummy would eventually get a second edition, even if it wasn't a guarantee at first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T10:23:03-07:00","id":1111697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1111685#post1111685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While the capital F 'Fall' did make me think Mage's Fall, as evidenced by my post, when you suggested I had the wrong idea I thought about other posts and then guessed you meant Rome, as we've had many Rome-oriented eras and a lot of people seem to want Rome to pop up for their favorite splat.</div> </div> </div> </div>too many things fall in CofD.. on the other hand, you know what they say? What rise must fall... :P<br /> <br /> Still, I must say that Constantinople's Dark Era just screams that it wants to be a Crossover one. I mean, not only it features Dracula (which is awesome), it also has one of the best Crossover Sidebars in it (the best, IMO)- three Prince war for the vampires (and again, Dracula), shattered Pure legion and mad spirits for werewolves, an artifact raiding adventure for Mages, a gathering of prometheans, something which builds itself from nightmares, hints about beasts which escape the shackles of the God Machine, undying murderer which takes the eyes of his victims, pits of Shuankshen waiting for careless Arisen- and, of course, hunters who need to deal with all the mess (with the AKD getting the front stage).<br /> <br /> Seriously, this Era is just perfect for Crossovers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T11:10:25-07:00","id":1111722,"title":"","content":"Promethean and Vampire during the Albigensian Crusade. The Prometheans are drawn to the conversation about the matter-spirit debate while Vampires are using the conflict to further their own agendas (with the religious among them drawn into the argument). I have to admit a certain bias on this one, as my favorite Vampire: Dark Ages campaign was set during this period, but I think there is a lot of potential.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T11:23:17-07:00","id":1111737,"title":"","content":"Dark Eras: World War (spanning both of them) seems easy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://