","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-07-2017, 01:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T00:06:42-07:00","id":1112534,"title":"","content":"We are 538 votes on Pirates Era and it looks like we have Mage on weak lead ( only 2-3% ) and perfectly equal Changeling and Geist as second ones. I start to think we return to DE 1 Kickstater 'my own favorite gameline' contest votes were going by half of event then, not what's really logical for the Era. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <b>Prepare for all Streach Goals Eras to be Mage, Changeling and maybe Vampire from now on. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T00:18:44-07:00","id":1112543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1112534#post1112534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We are 538 votes on Pirates Era and it looks like we have Mage on weak lead ( only 2-3% ) and perfectly equal Changeling and Geist as second ones. I start to think we return to DE 1 Kickstater 'my own favorite gameline' contest votes were going by half of event then, not what's really logical for the Era. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <b>Prepare for all Streach Goals Eras to be Mage, Changeling and maybe Vampire from now on. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></b></div> </div> </div> </div>Your argument falls apart when you consider that Vampire won none of the DE1 polls and Mummy - arguably the least-popular line - won several.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T00:39:38-07:00","id":1112550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1112543#post1112543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Your argument falls apart when you consider that Vampire won none of the DE1 polls and Mummy - arguably the least-popular line - won several.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, I looked only on number of topics and posts of gamlines subforums - but I remember that DE1 corebook did not have ( almost ) any Vampire Era. It's probably because <b>Requiem</b> has ALREADY two unofficial <b>Dark Eras</b>-like books, solely for Kindred - <b>Requiem for Rome</b> and <b>Ancient Mysteries</b>. Other major gamelines got only one <b>Dark Eras</b>-like material - I mean <i>Wolves of Bau</i> for Werewolf, <i>Mage Noir</i> and <i>Victorian Changeling</i>.<br /> <br /> Mummy won so many probably because of 'need of books' to it ( and how Mummy is historically centered game in it's all ) - and that in DE 1 corebook people were not sure to expect from Streach Goals, so voted on it dedicated minority in fandom.<br /> <br /> But I think we will see if Changeling, instead of Geist, will become Pirate Dark Era.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-07-2017, 03:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T00:39:38-07:00","id":1112551,"title":"","content":"( Double Post, sorry )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T00:54:34-07:00","id":1112553,"title":"","content":"Actually I believe Mummy only won one vote: the Cleopatra Era, which was surprising more because it was 'just another' Egyptian time for the game, which just had Sothis Ascends released. The Mutapa Kingdom Era was included, if I remember, because of a backer requesting its inclusion.<br /> <br /> So I might make the argument that Mummy wasn't that popular. Just had a couple die hard backer fans, including myself. The polls were pretty dominated by Mage, Changeling, and maybe Demon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T01:10:43-07:00","id":1112556,"title":"","content":"I apologize if this is the wrong area, but would 1963 (when J.F. Kennedy was assassinated, and Doctor Who first aired) or 1969 (when America stepped onto the moon) bad ideas for eras to suggest for the book to have? I honestly don't know if either of them are appealing, but I can see either era working for a Demon line, given the stresses involved?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T01:59:17-07:00","id":1112563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1112534#post1112534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We are 538 votes on Pirates Era and it looks like we have Mage on weak lead ( only 2-3% ) and perfectly equal Changeling and Geist as second ones. I start to think we return to DE 1 Kickstater 'my own favorite gameline' contest votes were going by half of event then, not what's really logical for the Era. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <b>Prepare for all Streach Goals Eras to be Mage, Changeling and maybe Vampire from now on. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></b></div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, Changeling may be getting a boost from its popularity, but Mage and Geist are favored here because of strong era associations. Mage has the Nassau conflict as a plot hook in its 2nd Edition core. Geist was the pick for Golden Age of Piracy in the first Dark Eras poll.<br /> <br /> I'm sure if we weren't looking at the Golden Age of Piracy and instead were looking at the Jazz Age, we'd be seeing Vampire surge way past Mage (though Geist would likely still be strong); while Meiji Restoration is a fan favorite for Werewolf; etc etc.<br /> <br /> If we had pre-Mutiny India or the birth of the Haudenosaunee, I'd be campaigning hard for Hunter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T02:00:01-07:00","id":1112564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1112556#post1112556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I apologize if this is the wrong area, but would 1963 (when J.F. Kennedy was assassinated, and Doctor Who first aired) or 1969 (when America stepped onto the moon) bad ideas for eras to suggest for the book to have? I honestly don't know if either of them are appealing, but I can see either era working for a Demon line, given the stresses involved?</div> </div> </div> </div>1969 is official time of return of first four Idigams from Moon in <b>Werewolf</b> - and start of 