</div>Well either way: I'd much rather run a CofD game in the setting of the ride over the movies. Mostly to get away from the baggage of the movie franchise. <br /> <br /> ...then again, theme park nerd over here, so y'know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T10:35:28-07:00","id":1112784,"title":"","content":"Whoever wins, I'd just say this again: <b>Black Sails is an awesome TV show about pirates, Nassau and Treasure Island and you should all check it out like, right now.</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">I totally think it's one of the best series ever and I'm kinda annoying about it</span><br /> <br /> Ahem. <br /> <br /> Yes, I remember the rider, mate, you're not alone in that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T11:05:25-07:00","id":1112794,"title":"","content":"Geist for the golden age of piracy era is a beautiful fit in my opinion. As for the wild west i'd also go with geist and promethean. <br /> If you want Werewolf in a similar context, i'd suggest going for earlier and ... northier .... with the exploration of the canadian frontier and the fur trade. I'd see that working as a werewolf and mage era.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T11:11:30-07:00","id":1112797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1112769#post1112769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mage won only a single vote in Dark Eras 1's kickstarter, and that was the one everyone was cheating on before we fixed the voting software. (to be fair, everyone was cheating in favour of the other games, too).</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"http://s2.quickmeme.com/img/4f/4f82556195299913c504f8c14f013133eab23cece4c485b0f4b6a2c80c4b4614.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> I definitely should have put it together when the cheating didn't help and for every extra vote I put in other slots got 20. In the end, none of my eras won and I withdrew my backing. Then the second tim around they all won, except Vampire, and I put it back in.<br /> <br /> I'm curious about what other potential stretch goals might be, especially compared to the list of player suggestions in this and other threads. My memory about these kind of things is crap but I think the first Dark Eras took a while to get started too. Things seemed to go faster during more enticing stretch goals, I think.<br /> <br /> WW1 was a nice pick for Werewolf. Beshilu and chemical weapons, trench warfare is perfect for the Uratha. I wonder if other developers and writers play these games in alternative eras, or how much their games influence the settings they work on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 07-07-2017, 02:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T12:09:00-07:00","id":1112828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1112794#post1112794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Geist for the golden age of piracy era is a beautiful fit in my opinion. As for the wild west i'd also go with geist and promethean. <br /> If you want Werewolf in a similar context, i'd suggest going for earlier and ... northier .... with the exploration of the canadian frontier and the fur trade. I'd see that working as a werewolf and mage era.</div> </div> </div> </div>But we already had Mage + Werewolf. Hmm. Wasn't there something Vampire related in Montreal?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T12:21:04-07:00","id":1112833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1112828#post1112828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But we already had Mage + Werewolf. Hmm. Wasn't there something Vampire related in Montreal?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 