one?<br /> <br /> And was it an option? Just having one huge era? Or did you have to decide on other eras?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T00:39:34-07:00","id":1113140,"title":"","content":"Finally done my pledge and we are at ( almost ) 32k $ on project, with 469 backers. I think we will hit 40k $ at the end of weekend - and with going for first Stretch Goal Pirate Era, maybe we will have unfolded second Stretch Goal Era?<br /> <br /> At Pirate voting, we are in 1067 votes and steady Geist and Mage lead by 7% over Changeling, each.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T00:46:17-07:00","id":1113142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1113128#post1113128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wow, which one?<br /> <br /> And was it an option? Just having one huge era? Or did you have to decide on other eras?</div> </div> </div> </div>We agreed having one Era that large was unreasonable. Then Given my second choice was also another's second choice, we came to an arrangement: I would boost To the Strongest and (i forgot his name) would boostThe Ruins of the Empire...the later did not turn out so well, so i believe he ended up influencing The Fall of Isireion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T01:43:55-07:00","id":1113152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1113099#post1113099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If more Expander slots become available, I'd definitely be willing to put up the funds to add Changelings to 1001 Nights, or Mages and the outbreak of the Nameless War to the French Revolution.</div> </div> </div> </div>Crossing fingers for those. Like I said before - opening choice of gamelines for those two important Eras was... not best and mentioned by <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a> games need those Eras more than others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-08-2017, 05:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T04:03:14-07:00","id":1113176,"title":"","content":"I wonder how the Era expansions will work this time. There's no listed word count, and I don't imagine there'll be more than one game added to an Era that already has two. French Revolution will be a popular one between the backers, I imagine.<br /> <br /> I was the Ruins of Empire and Fall of Isireion expansions backer, by the way. While the former was a disappointment, Rich and Matthew more than made it up to me with the latter. I harbor no ill will and am backing this Kickstarter as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T05:18:35-07:00","id":1113191,"title":"","content":"It might just be me but I would love to see a Roaring 20's era for mage. After I saw Fantastic beasts and where to find them I've been wanting a Mafia style mage game set in the roaring 1920 of NYC. Also because I love demon I would love to see demon set in that time.<br /> <br /> Also something set during the Mexican Revolution or War of the Holy League (1683 - 1699)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 07-08-2017, 08:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-08T06:09:40-07:00","id":1113204,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1113142#post1113142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We agreed having one Era that large was unreasonable. Then Given my second choice was also another's second choice, we came to an arrangement: I would boost To the Strongest and (i forgot his name) would boostThe Ruins of the Empire...the later did not turn out so well, so i believe he ended up influencing The Fall of Isireion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh, I never knew that. No such thing happened with the 5k expansions. I think everyone hashed it out here and on RPG.net as the Kickstarter was wrapping up. So did all three