 class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1113645#post1113645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They already did not use Freanch Revolution for Mage or Islamic Golden Age for Changeling, so...</div> </div> </div> </div>What? I mentioned those in reference to the expansion reward tier. I don't know what point you're trying to make here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T02:58:23-07:00","id":1113671,"title":"","content":"I mean that using or not using gameline in the past have not reasons for making or not Era in DE2 - as Geist+Changeling example shown - and only counts fandom race and votes count. It 's pitty, but it's reality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T04:00:31-07:00","id":1113675,"title":"","content":"Gotta say, I still can't decide whether I'd personally restrict the chance to vote only to those who pledge, but having 1600+ votes for the poll while the Kickstarter only has 512 backers does feel wrong","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T09:08:20-07:00","id":1113763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1113675#post1113675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gotta say, I still can't decide whether I'd personally restrict the chance to vote only to those who pledge, but having 1600+ votes for the poll while the Kickstarter only has 512 backers does feel wrong</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there's a whole raft of reasons someone might have a vested interest in the book but not in backing the kickstarter. Probably a defensible position to give them a say in the book content if it would make them more or less likely to buy it. At which point it's hard to lock it down based on something so fuzzy.<br /> <br /> I know myself I adopted a rule of not backing more OP kickstarters until I'd received the last thing I kickstarted from them. It's been a couple of years wait now but I'd still be pretty interested in POD Dark Ages 2 if it included Golden Age of Piracy for Mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/836-obyrne","name":"Obyrne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T09:32:44-07:00","id":1113770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Obyrne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1113763#post1113763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, there's a whole raft of reasons someone might have a vested interest in the book but not in backing the kickstarter. Probably a defensible position to give them a say in the book content if it would make them more or less likely to buy it. At which point it's hard to lock it down based on something so fuzzy.<br /> <br /> I know myself I adopted a rule of not backing more OP kickstarters until I'd received the last thing I kickstarted from them. It's been a couple of years wait now but I'd still be pretty interested in POD Dark Ages 2 if it included Golden Age of Piracy for Mage.</div> </div> </div> </div>I positive most of the votes in the poll are people either gaming the system or trying to counteract others from gaming it. Why? 2700 votes is almost twice the number of people who backed the original Kickstarter. I have a hard time believing that those many votes represent people who backed the last Dark Eras but are waiting on this one. Especially because they know they need to back in order to actually get the era the are voting for. You are right that there are many reasons people are voting but not backing, but I don't think it follows through when there are over five times as many votes as there are backers and people on 4Chan are allegedly trying to troll the poll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T09:33:21-07:00","id":1113771,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/chronicles-of-darkness-dark-eras-2/posts/1932810\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects.../posts/1932810</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T09:57:35-07:00","id":1113779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Obyrne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1113763#post1113763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, there's a whole raft of reasons someone might have a vested interest in the book but not in backing the kickstarter. Probably a defensible position to give them a say in the book content if it would make them more or less likely to buy it. At which point it's hard to lock it down based on something so fuzzy.<br /> <br /> I know myself I adopted a rule of not backing more OP kickstarters until I'd received the last thing I kickstarted from them. It's been a couple of years wait now but I'd still be pretty interested in POD Dark Ages 2 if it included Golden Age of Piracy for Mage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is fair, I would not dare to constest people's motives or tell them how to spend their money, but at the same time there's a clear gap between people who are interested in the project and a number of votes that just does not add up.<br /> <br /> Look, I get that people might not have the money to invest <i>right now </i>or would be interested only in a book that has the Eras they want and vote for but, even considering them, the number of votes we have compared to the state of the Kickstarter is somewhat disappointing at best and a frankly sad joke at worst. We know for sure that there's people trying to rig the vote, it's a fact, and that's not even accounting for some of the weirder voices out there.<br /> <br /> I may try my hardest to think the best about everyone, but as I look at a Kickstarter that has yet to be funded but whose future developments depends on an outstanding number of votes that don't belong to the backers, I can't help but to think something is going wrong. We're not talking about a percentage of, i don't know, 500 backers and 800 votes: the votes are more than five times the number of backers.<br /> <br /> At this point, I'd honestly suggest to add a little pledge option, like 5 dollars, to give people the right to vote. I know that can be bypassed, that nothing stops people from deleting their pledge later and that might potentially draw less people in, but it's a pretty much a symbolic sum that would still help the project and represent a thin barrier between odd numbers and reality. If the vote numbers were real, we would have funded the book already with such an option. And I know it does sound dickish, but those 5 dollars would not ruin anyone and still support a Kickstarter and a company that we actually care for.<br /> <br /> Showing my cards more clearly, I can't exactly afford to spend my money around that easily, I saved money for a considerable amount of time for this Kickstarter. While I'm not in the position to say what others should do, I do feel like those who want to give shape to this book might contribute a little. The result can only give a better book for everyone.<br /> <br /> And no, this is not even about Pirate Geist, I'm already going through the 5 stages of grief for that one: it's about seeing a project I care for be funded and its development being determined by a number of my peers that also wish for it to have success. I don't care if &quot;my chapters&quot; don't happen, but when the votes are so disconnected from the number of actual backers, it's just does not feel right, whether this makes me look like a jerk or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T10:04:10-07:00","id":1113781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1113779#post1113779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which is fair, I would not dare to constest people's motives or tell them how to spend their money, but at the same time there's a clear gap between people who are interested in the project and a number of votes that just does not add up.<br /> <br /> Look, I get that people might not have the money to invest <i>right now </i>or would be interested only in a book that has the Eras they want and vote for but, even considering them, the number of votes we have compared to the state of the Kickstarter is somewhat disappointing at best and a frankly sad joke at worst. We know for sure that there's people trying to rig the vote, it's a fact, and that's not even accounting for some of the weirder voices out there.<br /> <br /> I may try my hardest to think the best about everyone, but as I look at a Kickstarter that has yet to be funded but whose future developments depends on an outstanding number of votes that don't belong to the backers, I can't help but to think something is going wrong. We're not talking about a percentage of, i don't know, 500 backers and 800 votes: the votes are more than five times the number of backers.<br /> <br /> At this point, I'd honestly suggest to add a little pledge option, like 5 dollars, to give people the right to vote. I know that can be bypassed, that nothing stops people from deleting their pledge later and that might potentially draw less people in, but it's a pretty much a symbolic sum that would still help the project and represent a thin barrier between odd numbers and reality. If the vote numbers were real, we would have funded the book already with such an option. And I know it does sound dickish, but those 5 dollars would not ruin anyone and still support a Kickstarter and a company that we actually care for.<br /> <br /> Showing my cards more clearly, I can't exactly afford to spend my money around that easily, I saved money for a considerable amount of time for this Kickstarter. While I'm not in the position to say what others should do, I do feel like those who want to give shape to this book might contribute a little. The result can only give a better book for everyone.<br /> <br /> And no, this is not even about Pirate Geist, I'm already going through the 5 stages of grief for that one: it's about seeing a project I care for be funded and its development being determined by a number of my peers that also wish for it to have success. I don't care if &quot;my chapters&quot; don't happen, but when the votes are so disconnected from the number of actual backers, it's just does not feel right, whether this makes me look like a jerk or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>All of this. I am 100% behind having a cheap voting option. I love this Kickstarter, and I know that it will be an awesome book no matter what happens, but this is frustrating beyond belief. If people want something different than me, that's fine. If people are intentionally subverting the poll, that is completely different. I have asked on Kickstarter that if the polls can be fixed before the stretch goal is hit, that the poll be restarted. Because right now, this is a joke.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>