ass=\"message\">In other news, Rich noted in the MM comments that the individual Eras will be a bit heftier this time around, which sounds like each era will be about the size of two Eras from DE1</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm surprised, the book was originally stated to be 180 pages, with 6 eras that's still 30 pages an era. Though I guess it does say 180+ page, and they probably will cut back on the Introductory section.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T13:22:24-07:00","id":1114721,"title":"","content":"Do you think next rather then Eras they could do places around the world. Such as Mages in Japan","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T13:35:20-07:00","id":1114728,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1114721#post1114721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you think next rather then Eras they could do places around the world. Such as Mages in Japan</div> </div> </div> </div>Mages in Japan is in the Mage core book. I'd be surprised if there was any 'modern' Dark Eras but I suppose anything's possible. Seems like it would be more likely in some other book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T15:52:21-07:00","id":1114792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1114523#post1114523\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> With the first one that was announced I think during the opening of the Kickstarter, some of the pledges were just for individual splats, so you could have just pledged for the Vampire gameline and only gotten the relevant eras.<br /> <br /> 'You'll receive a PDF of the Vampire: the Requiem chapter and you will receive any additional VtR material that is created because of Stretch Goals. You or your character's name will be listed on the credits page as a Vampire Follower.'</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but that wasn't for physical copies. I don't mind PDFs, but my wife can't use them at all if she actually wants to read material. Plus the other thing was that some of the eras we wanted/didn't want were not aligned nicely along specific game lines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T21:15:58-07:00","id":1114900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1114728#post1114728\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mages in Japan is in the Mage core book. I'd be surprised if there was any 'modern' Dark Eras but I suppose anything's possible. Seems like it would be more likely in some other book.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have ideas for very recent Dark Eras (I sketched them out for a massive hypothetical campaign jumping back a decade at a time).<br /> <br /> The 2010s was going to be Fourth Turn Mummies waking up in the midst of the Arab Spring, European Austerity protests/riots, and the degrading wary days of the crisis in the Ukraine.<br /> <br /> 2000s was going to be Changelings in Iraq in the immediate aftermath of the US invasion, playing into some Sandman &quot;Ramadan&quot; themes Changeling society being torn between the preserved folklore and the mortal reality.<br /> <br /> 1990s was American Werewolves in London - drawing heavily on Shadows of the UK, having Uratha refugees from the Brethren War flooding into the UK when the spirit world goes through a massive cyclical revolution with Diana's death.<br /> <br /> 1980s was New Wave Requiem<br /> <br /> 1970s was Bowery Dogs<br /> <br /> 1960s was Out in the Cold<br /> <br /> 1950s was Gods Oen Country<br /> <br /> 1940s was Mage Noir<br /> <br /> 1930s was Handful of Dust<br /> <br /> 1920s was going to be a Vampire/Beast crossover in the Harlem Renaissance<br /> <br /> 1910s was Master's Tools, but I might try to work in Great War Werewolf/Geist<br /> <br /> 1900s was Ruins of Empire<br /> <br /> 1890s was a massive crossover set in the Chicago World's Fair<br /> <br /> 1880s would be Victorian Changeling with Hunter elements via the Ripper murders<br /> <br /> .... ....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 07-12-2017, 12:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T21:22:38-07:00","id":1114901,"title":"","content":"We are (just) after 39k $, so today we will fund it. Question is - When we will see this more secured poll? Or maybe we will see next announced Stretch Goal? With 2k $ a day, we will have fund Pirate Era in one week. \ud83d\ude0a","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","use