39-07:00","id":1114965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1114912#post1114912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that was pretty clearly the likely case (that it would be the next poll).</div> </div> </div> </div>So the Click War will continue until we unlock Pirate Era? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Only next Stretch Goal will have new poll system? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> If that will be case, we will have once again weird fandom race in about week, when Pirate Era will be close funding... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Now we have 5694 votes on Pirate Era, with Mage and Geist having 29% each, and Changeling 26% on votes. Compare it to 604 KS backers we now have and see how this old poll is detached from reality. ( Even if % of backer maybe similar, in the end - most active users on forum post Mage, Geist or Changeling as their types for this Era. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-12-2017, 03:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T07:21:15-07:00","id":1115084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1114900#post1114900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have ideas for very recent Dark Eras (I sketched them out for a massive hypothetical campaign jumping back a decade at a time).<br /> <br /> The 2010s was going to be Fourth Turn Mummies waking up in the midst of the Arab Spring, European Austerity protests/riots, and the degrading wary days of the crisis in the Ukraine.<br /> <br /> 2000s was going to be Changelings in Iraq in the immediate aftermath of the US invasion, playing into some Sandman &quot;Ramadan&quot; themes Changeling society being torn between the preserved folklore and the mortal reality.<br /> <br /> 1990s was American Werewolves in London - drawing heavily on Shadows of the UK, having Uratha refugees from the Brethren War flooding into the UK when the spirit world goes through a massive cyclical revolution with Diana's death.<br /> <br /> 1980s was New Wave Requiem<br /> <br /> 1970s was Bowery Dogs<br /> <br /> 1960s was Out in the Cold<br /> <br /> 1950s was Gods Oen Country<br /> <br /> 1940s was Mage Noir<br /> <br /> 1930s was Handful of Dust<br /> <br /> 1920s was going to be a Vampire/Beast crossover in the Harlem Renaissance<br /> <br /> 1910s was Master's Tools, but I might try to work in Great War Werewolf/Geist<br /> <br /> 1900s was Ruins of Empire<br /> <br /> 1890s was a massive crossover set in the Chicago World's Fair<br /> <br /> 1880s would be Victorian Changeling with Hunter elements via the Ripper murders<br /> <br /> .... ....</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I would love to see a Mage/Demon Noir. Most because I freaking Love Noir","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T11:31:04-07:00","id":1115154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1114965#post1114965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So the Click War will continue until we unlock Pirate Era? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Only next Stretch Goal will have new poll system? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> If that will be case, we will have once again weird fandom race in about week, when Pirate Era will be close funding... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Now we have 5694 votes on Pirate Era, with Mage and Geist having 29% each, and Changeling 26% on votes. Compare it to 604 KS backers we now have and see how this old poll is detached from reality. ( Even if % of backer maybe similar, in the end - most active users on forum post Mage, Geist or Changeling as their types for this Era. )</div> </div> </div> </div>While yes, the numbers are rather a lot...it's not like the graph looks too terribly different from how it was when it had about 500 votes. Mage and Changeling are just stupidly popular, and Geist has a lot of reasons for the tie-ins, as has been discussed. Sure, the actual numbers are aberrant, but the proportions are about the same as they have always been.<br /> <br /> You'd probably be better served by not freaking out over it. What happens happens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T11:49:52-07:00","id":1115167,"title":"","content":"Thus far, Mage and Geist are winning, with Changeling closely behind. Which are the 3 splats that fit best* anyways. <br /> <br /> Ideally, a backer will turn it into an era for all 3, so the current race doesn't even have any uncertainty. It hardly matters which are first or second, then.<br /> <br /> * Opinion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T11:54:01-07:00","id":1115169,"title":"","content":"The cheating started before we even had 200 backers. The proportions are the same because the cheaters have been cheating since the start.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T12:01:32-07:00","id":1115175,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1115169#post1115169\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The cheating started before we even had 200 backers. The proportions are the same because the cheaters have been cheating since the start.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let me ask it this way then: If all the cheat votes were removed and it was just the votes of the backers, would you really expect to see the proportions be different, in the grand haul?<br /> <br /> Cause-and this might just be me-I think Mage, Changeling, and Geist would still be leading.<br /> <br /> Also, as regards the post I referred to, it's kind of hard to take complaints about cheating seriously from people who propose cheating right back.(Not aimed at you, No)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T12:08:54-07:00","id":1115180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1115175#post1115175\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let me ask it this way then: If all the cheat votes were removed and it was just the votes of the backers, would you really expect to see the proportions be different, in the grand haul?<br /> <br /> Cause-and this might just be me-I think Mage, Changeling, and Geist would still be leading.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think Hunter would be among them, if they were in the lead at all.<br /> <br /> No offense to Geist, but it's little known inside of the community and even less known outside, I think a majority of its votes are from a substantially smaller part of the backers. Similarly Mage. The push for Mage has been mostly focused from here, this forum, with an insistence that we see the Seers and Diamond Orders team up. And really I'd guess Changeling is only there because a Changeling fan decided they didn't like the other two telling everyone else 'Fuck your vote I want what I want,' so decided to do the same to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 07-12-2017, 03:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T12:13:16-07:00","id":1115181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1115180#post1115180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think Hunter would be among them, if they were in the lead at all.<br /> <br /> No offense to Geist, but it's little known inside of the community and even less known outside, I think a majority of its votes are from a substantially smaller part of the backers. Similarly Mage. The push for Mage has been mostly focused from here, with an insistence that we see the Seers and Diamond Orders team up. And really I'd guess Changeling is only there because a Changeling fan decided they didn't like the other two telling everyone else 'Fuck your vote I want what I want,' so decided to do the same to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd argue the Changeling one is an uncharitable reading, because dear god, Changeling is popular as these lines go. Everything else is kind of &quot;Eh?&quot; I see what you're getting at, but I'm not sure I agree.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T12:22:59-07:00","id":1115184,"title":"","content":"Honestly I thought they we're going to restart the poll with a version that fixes the problem of cheating. I think the poll issue is putting a damper on people donating to the kick starter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:i