f the historical settings really interest me and I would rather much have Signs of Sorcery (or at least an faq) or 2nd ed books for Geist and Changeling.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then this probably isn't the book - or thread - for you. Dave Brookshaw is not a developer on Dark Eras 2, nor is Travis, the dev for Geist2, and CtL2 has moved past writing and related developer work, so Dark Eras 2 has no impact on whether the books you are interested in move forward to release.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T07:15:02-07:00","id":1119497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1119493#post1119493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Then this probably isn't the book - or thread - for you. Dave Brookshaw is not a developer on Dark Eras 2, nor is Travis, the dev for Geist2, and CtL2 has moved past writing and related developer work, so Dark Eras 2 has no impact on whether the books you are interested in move forward to release.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry? Guess I'll just take my business elsewhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":""