<div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seidmadr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1119688#post1119688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have no preference one way or another for this one.<br /> Or... No. I'd love Arthurian Mage, but since we got Mage Pirates, we won't get that.<br /> So I don't care one way or another here.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know. While anything would work in the Arthurian setting (Mummy and Deviant might not be obvious, but I can still see some great ideas available), seeing Myrddin's Ascension would be <i>epic</i>. Mage + Changeling would fit very well. But, as you said, we just had a Mage era.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T17:28:12-07:00","id":1119693,"title":"","content":"I have a childhood obsession for Myrddin and the few sparse mention we have of him in a Mage context are made of awesomeness. If it depended on me (which does not, not to mention people expressed clearly what they wanted, but still), I'd rather have no Mage pirates and have Arthurian Mage instead. Oh well. Hindsight is meaningless anyways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T17:41:33-07:00","id":1119701,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1119693#post1119693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a childhood obsession for Myrddin and the few sparse mention we have of him in a Mage context are made of awesomeness. If it depended on me (which does not, not to mention people expressed clearly what they wanted, but still), I'd rather have no Mage pirates and have Arthurian Mage instead. Oh well. Hindsight is meaningless anyways.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ah, but how were we to know what options came next?<br /> <br /> This is a situation where it looks awesome regardless of what gets picked. And that there is only so much room for great content.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T17:46:02-07:00","id":1119703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1119701#post1119701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Ah, but how were we to know what options came next?<br /> <br /> This is a situation where it looks awesome regardless of what gets picked. And that there is only so much room for great content.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, we indeed had no way to know. As I said, hindsight's a bitch. But I sound more sour than I am: Mage Pirates will likely be great and all the options of this round have great potential for pretty much all gamelines.<br /> <br /> It's just me pretending to be dramatic when I'm chatty. Guilty pleasure of mine, sorry about that <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divide