"value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T10:49:50-07:00","id":1121388,"title":"","content":"So the next three Eras up:<br /> <br /> Necropolis of Hawara (Egypt, 1604-1204 BCE)<br /> Greco-Persian Wars (499-449 BCE)<br /> Mississippi Steamboat Era (1811-1861)<br /> <br /> ...yeah I need to hear a bit more before deciding on a vote.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T10:51:19-07:00","id":1121389,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1121386#post1121386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seems like it would focus on the Necropolis at Hawara. And the Greco-Persian wars were pretty expansive, the Athenian Navy played a nice part. I'll have to wait until we hear more. The Golden Age of Steamboats seems like an odd choice, but maybe they have a good pitch for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually think steamboats would be really interesting solely on the fact it is so oddball. Egypt gets my vote though. I totally get why people seem psyched for Persian Wars, and I would be too, but I think we have more than enough Dark Eras in the Hellenistic world at this point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T10:53:15-07:00","id":1121392,"title":"","content":"And we are past $50 000! I assume Arthurian Britain won, and on Kickstarter page there is not changed what gamelins are unlocked, but new poll is up to choose between:<ul><li>Necropolis of Hawara ( Egypt, 1604-1204 BCE )</li> <li>Greco-Persian Wars ( 499-449 BCE )</li> <li>Missisipi Steamboat Era ( 1811-1861 )</li> </ul>For me, the choice is simple - I do not need next Egypt material with having <i>To the Strongest</i> and , related, <i>Princes of Conquared Lands</i>. And Missisipi Era is just next to <i>Fearfull Lesson</i> from <b>DE 1 </b><b>Companion</b>.<br /> <br /> I vote for Greco-Persian Wars to see maybe mentioning on Panscryptia creation as Persian sect for <b>Mage</b>. And even if not - I <i>really</i> love <b>300</b> franchise! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-27-2017, 02:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T11:01:34-07:00","id":1121397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1121392#post1121392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And we are past $50 000! I assume Arthurian Britain won, and on Kickstarter page there is not changed what gamelins are unlocked, but new poll is up to choose between:<ul><li>Necropolis of Hawara ( Egypt, 1604-1204 BCE )</li> <li>Greco-Persian Wars ( 499-449 BCE )</li> <li>Missisipi Steamboat Era ( 1811-1861 )</li> </ul>For me, the choice is simple - I do not need next Egypt material with having <i>To the Strongest</i> and , related, <i>Princes of Conquared Lands</i>. And Missisipi Era is just next to <i>Fearfull Lesson</i> from <b>DE 1 </b><b>Companion</b>.<br /> <br /> I vote for Greco-Persian Wars to see maybe mentioning on Panscryptia creation as Persian sect. And even if not - I really love <b>300</b> franchise! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>By that logic, Greco-Roman Wars is the one you don't need. Egypt in this Era is completely different and one that doesn't actually get lots of coverage. If you want Greco-Persian Wars, by all means vote for it, it will be a neat era, but I don't think you logic here follows.<br /> <br /> Also, how is Princes of the Conquered Land remotely relevant here? It's 3000 years later in an area of Africa completely different from Egypt. That's like saying we don't need Arthurian Britannia because we have Russian Revolution already, and for all we know, this could be a Demon/Hunter era. While Mummy is the obvious line, it is far from the only one that features in Ancient Egypt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 07-27-2017, 02:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T11:02:48-07:00","id":1121398,"title":"","content":"I must say I know practically nothing about two of the three Eras (that is, I am only familiar with the Greco-Persian Wars), so I vote for the Mississippi because it is the most modern one. Is there anyone to actually clear up what exactly the Mississippi and Hawara Eras may be about?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T11:05:33-07:00","id":1121400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1121392#post1121392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And we are past $50 000! I assume Arthurian Britain won, and on Kickstarter page there is not changed what gamelins are unlocked, but new poll is up to choose between:<ul><li>Necropolis of Hawara ( Egypt, 1604-1204 BCE )</li> <li>Greco-Persian Wars ( 499-449 BCE )</li> <li>Missisipi Steamboat Era ( 1811-1861 )</li> </ul>For me, the choice is simple - I do not need next Egypt material with having <i>To the Strongest</i> and , related, <i>Princes of Conquared Lands</i>. And Missisipi Era is just next to <i>Fearfull Lesson</i> from <b>DE 1 </b><b>Companion</b>.<br /> <br /> I vote for Greco-Persian Wars to see maybe mentioning on Panscryptia creation as Persian sect for <b>Mage</b>. And even if not - I <i>really</i> love <b>300</b> franchise! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>To The Strongest is set a thousand years after the Egyptian setting there, what are you talking about? By that same logic, we don't need that Greek setting for the same reason.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T11:07:51-07:00","id":1121405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1121398#post1121398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I must say I know practically nothing about two of the three Eras (that is, I am only familiar with the Greco-Persian Wars), so I vote for the Mississippi because it is the most modern one. Is there anyone to actually clear up what exactly the Mississippi and Hawara Eras may be about?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, for Egypt you can start here:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hawara\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Limestone_pyramid._Mr._F._Petrie_thought_that_this_represented_a_model_for_Hawara_pyramid._12th_Dynasty._From_Hawara%2C_Egypt._The_Petrie_Museum_of_Egyptian_Archaeology%2C_London.jpg/1280px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\