mbraced an angel.<br /> <br /> It seems an anti-God-Machine vampire cult.<br /> <br /> From Meghan's update, 'We\u2019ll also take a closer look at a covenant that, in later years, will become little more than an urban legend \u2014 even now, the Tenth Choir moves like a shadow to avoid the wrath of the Church Eternal, slipping into cahoots with demonic beings whose beef with divinity is more immediate and more personal. Other covenants take different stands and find themselves allying with or opposing demons who seem to come out of the woodwork everywhere they turn.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-31T12:47:11-07:00","id":1123126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1123121#post1123121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Other covenants take different stands and find themselves allying with or opposing demons who seem to come out of the woodwork everywhere they turn.'</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh. Depending on Form Abilities (like Collapsible) or their prior Angelic Cover (like with Lares), Demons might <i>literally</i> be coming out of the woodwork.","signature":"<hr