e Vigil? The Council of Bones and the Lucifuge? The Ageis Kai Doru and the Mallius Malficarum? The Acheron Group? They all pervert themselves by using magic to hunt monsters. Witches can see the realms from which they draw their magic, and so turn it against them. On Madagascar, we made no such mistake. <br /> <br /> Right now I'm leading towards Mage 1001 Nights, but as always, I am open to suggestions, and may change my mind. Also, if other expansion backers are lurking here, you are welcome, nay encouraged, to steal what I've written for your own pitches.</div> </div> </div> </div> Earlier you suggested Demon for Authur era, I'm curious as to why, it would be an unexpected choice?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T10:07:48-07:00","id":1124822,"title":"","content":"*grumbles about 1001 Nights needing Changeling*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T10:30:46-07:00","id":1124827,"title":"","content":"I'm curious if expanders can choose the new eras of Hawara, Authur, Pirates, and whatever is next, or even the era the Master Creator picks (would love to know who the Master Creator of Darkness is and what they will pick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T11:17:58-07:00","id":1124842,"title":"","content":"I'm tempted to start ending every post with &quot;also, we need Changeling for 1001 Nights,&quot; Cato-style.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124820#post1124820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Earlier you suggested Demon for Authur era, I'm curious as to why, it would be an unexpected choice?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd imagine it would have something to do with the stories of Merlin being half-demon. Or else examining the complicated situation that Christianity is in immediately after the Romans leave, what with the Pelagian heresy, and what Demons think about a doctrine that says everyone is capable of making the choice between good and evil, and whether they see any reflection how they live. Plus strange Cryptids like long-necked leopards with a stomach full of baying dogs (or maybe it just projects that noise from speakers on its stomach as a form of camouflage, or as a lure for those lost in the woods, or as a way of mimicking the local wildlife). And the strange gadget that the king's sword is sheathed in, one that seems to have temporal control over injuries and resets battles until the wielder finds a way to win. And that one piece of Infrastructure that connects the fertility of the surrounding area with the physical well-being of a specific Stigmatic, and how a recent battle injury threatens to lead to the starvation of thousands.<br /> <br /> Admittedly, most of those examples would work just as well in Changeling: Merlin as potentially a child of the Gentry or an enterprising Changeling himself, Changelings turning to Christianity to try to understand their suffering (and just look at poems like <i>The Dream of the Rood </i>for an interesting British conception of Christ-as-warrior and active participant in his crucifixion), the Questing Beast as a Hedge-beast, Excalibur and its scabbard as artifacts from Arcadia, and the Fisher King as having screwed up a certain Goblin Contract horribly, requiring the PCs to find a loophole to mend the land or else some way of mending his uncurable wound.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">also we need Changeling for 1001 Nights</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12958,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12958-raz_fox","user":"Raz_Fox","date":". 08-04-2017, 02:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12958-raz_fox","name":"Raz_Fox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T11:35:21-07:00","id":1124851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124822#post1124822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*grumbles about 1001 Nights needing Changeling*</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, you may still get it, it is a good fit. It just won't come from my quarter. As I've said, I have lots of fish to fry in the Golden Islamic Age, and most of those are tied to Mage for better or for worse. Think a Mage/Changeling/Beast 1001 Nights would be stellar, but I can't do that on my own. And I don't even know if we'll be allowed to add two lines to the same era.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T11:38:21-07:00","id":1124854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raz_Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124842#post1124842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm tempted to start ending every post with &amp;quot;also, we need Changeling for 1001 Nights,&amp;quot; Cato-style.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I'd imagine it would have something to do with the stories of Merlin being half-demon. Or else examining the complicated situation that Christianity is in immediately after the Romans leave, what with the Pelagian heresy, and what Demons think about a doctrine that says everyone is capable of making the choice between good and evil, and whether they see any reflection how they live. Plus strange Cryptids like long-necked leopards with a stomach full of baying dogs (or maybe it just projects that noise from speakers on its stomach as a form of camouflage, or as a lure for those lost in the woods, or as a way of mimicking the local wildlife). And the strange gadget that the king's sword is sheathed in, one that seems to have temporal control over injuries and resets battles until the wielder finds a way to win. And that one piece of Infrastructure that connects the fertility of the surrounding area with the physical well-being of a specific Stigmatic, and how a recent battle injury threatens to lead to the starvation of thousands.<br /> <br /> Admittedly, most of those examples would work just as well in Changeling: Merlin as potentially a child of the Gentry or an enterprising Changeling himself, Changelings turning to Christianity to try to understand their suffering (and just look at poems like <i>The Dream of the Rood </i>for an interesting British conception of Christ-as-warrior and active participant in his crucifixion), the Questing Beast as a Hedge-beast, Excalibur and its scabbard as artifacts from Arcadia, and the Fisher King as having screwed up a certain Goblin Contract horribly, requiring the PCs to find a loophole to mend the land or else some way of mending his uncurable wound.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">also we need Changeling for 1001 Nights</span></div> </div> </div> </div>That's certainly what prompted my brainstorm, but what has kept in the running for me is the way you can make Mage, Changeling, and Demon overlap, particularly when it comes to sacred vows. There are a lot of really interesting parallels and questions once you start looking at them though. Here's my pitch:<br /> <br /> <b>Arthurian Britannia</b> (MtA/CtL/DtD)<br /> Merlin always said that Oaths were important. Many say that he was a fae poet. Others claim he was a mighty sorcerer. Some even whisper he was the son of the Devil himself. Whatever the truth may be, the Romans agreed that Oaths are important, but now Rome is leaving the shores, leaving us to the Angles and the Saxons. Faeries and Demons lurk in the dark alleys and forests, weaving pledges and pacts while buying and selling fates in Goblin Markets. Mages cultivate Proximi dynasties, while Demons seek aid from their Offspring. Neither realize that these Children of the Round Table are actually one and the same, and they have become very adept at pulling the strings of their erstwhile minders. How are the Offspring able to hide from the Mage's Supernal Sight? And what do they see when they look at Demons or Changelings? The Fetches that the Gentry have left behind are forced to looks at Demons and ask: are these monsters more or less human than I am? And can any of these creatures contend with the inexorable spread of the God-Machine and it's angels as they work to build their own personal Camelot?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T12:58:31-07:00","id":1124902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124744#post1124744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That said, I'd be kind of disappointed if it went to Demon. It's already fairly simple to take a science fiction approach to Demon, so going with that one strikes me as low-hanging fruit. It's not that I don't think it would be awesome, but I'd prefer to see something a little less expected for that one. Personally I'd like to see Changeling for that one, but I'm biased, so take that for what it's worth. I'd still want to see Deviant for it, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>For <i>Golden Age of S-F</i>, I would LOVE to see <b>Deviant + Promethean</b> combo - both are having fairly S-F elements, but also on the other hand, both has lot's of really non-science pieces ( magical rituals in <b>Deviant </b>and alchemy in <b>Promethean</b> ). AND both are about deconstruction of racism and xenophobia, like <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a> pointed out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:02:07-07:00","id":1124903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124902#post1124902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For <i>Golden Age of S-F</i>, I would LOVE to see <b>Deviant + Promethean</b> combo - both are having fairly S-F elements, but also on the other hand, both has lot's of really non-science pieces ( magical rituals in <b>Deviant </b>and alchemy in <b>Promethean</b> ). AND both are about deconstruction of racism and xenophobia, like <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a> pointed out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>On this we agree. Actually, given their astronomical inclinations, Deviant/Promethean/Mummy would be a really cool take on this era as a triplet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:04:09-07:00","id":1124904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124822#post1124822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*grumbles about 1001 Nights needing Changeling*</div> </div> </div> </div>1001 Nights need <b>both</b> Mage &amp; Changeling expansions. I was really weird they chosen Vampire &amp; Beast on the start, even if I can see them more or less work on later thoughts in Kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:10:50-07:00","id":1124911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124809#post1124809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Great War</b> (WtF/PtC/GtSE)<br /> Promethean walk the land and new lineage is born out of the gas attacks, starting at Ypres, but they are not the only Created to create Wastelands in no man's lands. The Ulgan across France, Belgium, and Germany can sense the turmoil that the spirits are in because of the war and urge every throng they cross to come to the aid of the Werewolves desperately trying to keep them in check, even if that means crossing into the Shadow. Meanwhile, Prometheans well on their pilgrimage feel stirrings from the Underworld, and feel compelled to journey physically to the Rivers of Death to investigate, even as Sin-Eaters do the same. As the Created journey farther afield into the supernatural realms, they find the Shadow and Underworld roiling in unexpected ways, and must learn how to interact with ghosts, spirits, and cthonians... and how their disquiet impacts each one.</div> </div> </div> </div>After watching last <b>Wonder Women</b> movie, you can add my vote also on this combo - Promethean seems to work with Great War in unexpected way.<br /> <br /> Still, my own private advise on your expansions would be 1001 Nights Mage - so in my private fan advising voting it would be this priority:<br /> <br /> 1. 1001 Nights Mage.<br /> 2. Great War Promethean.<br /> 3. Pirates Hunter. <br /> <br /> Amen! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:37:39-07:00","id":1124921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124904#post1124904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1001 Nights need <b>both</b> Mage &amp; Changeling expansions. I was really weird they chosen Vampire &amp; Beast on the start, even if I can see them more or less work on later thoughts in Kickstarter.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm starting to get why its Vampire/Beast now, although I went into it expecting Changeling too. The funny thing is that I had put the Mage expansion entirely on the backburner a while ago since I didn't see what I wanted to do with Mage fitting with the 1001 Nights theme. I figured it out though when I realized that the theme centres around legends... and that one of the most tenacious myths to come out of the Golden Age was the Assassin Legends. Even though that's not part of the 1001 Nights proper, it still fits in. I also think that it would be neat to see some Vampire/Mage cooperation that lays part the groundwork for the Ordo Dracul to rise after this era, as well as find out what the Strix look like under Mage Sight. We will see though.<br /> <br /> $1901 to go. Sci-Fi back in the lead. Also, you know what would be an awesome triplet for that era as well? Werewolf/Promethean/Deviant. The Golden Age of Science Fiction allowed people to envision new possibilities, ideal worlds, and fears. What does that mean? New Spirits. Have fun in the Shadow, pups.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 08-04-2017, 04:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:41:08-07:00","id":1124922,"title":"","content":"Found I have stashed on second card almost 100 z\u0142oty, so raised my pledge to 30$ for this shiny <b>Promethean</b> 2E PDF for me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> We are now at $58,099 in Kickstarter, so only 1900$ in 19 hours for our great Medieval Ireland or Golden Age of S-F - we can do it, guys! Simply raise your pledges!<br /> <br /> At poll we are at 199 votes for S-F Age and 195 for Ireland - both ways I win! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-04-2017, 04:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:44:53-07:00","id":1124924,"title":"","content":"We are getting close to the point where the one $750 pledge could do a lot. Part of me is holding out hope for one last push for a stretch goal after this one... or that Rich will be super nice and make it a short one!<br /> <br /> EDIT: The Kicktraq trend line has needled its way back above $60,000! We are making progress!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 08-04-2017, 04:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:48:38-07:00","id":1124926,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124921#post1124921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I figured it out though when I realized that the theme centres around legends... and that one of the most tenacious myths to come out of the Golden Age was the Assassin Legends. Even though that's not part of the 1001 Nights proper, it still fits in. I also think that it would be neat to see some Vampire/Mage cooperation that lays part the groundwork for the Ordo Dracul to rise after this era, as well as find out what the Strix look like under Mage Sight. We will see though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Love to see some pre-Ordo Dracul faction from vampires and mages that will lay works for the Dracul to expand upon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And yes, really wanting to see Awakened alchemist of Islam and redefination of Assasin's, in light of Diamond vs Seers conflict.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:52:14-07:00","id":1124929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124924#post1124924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We are getting close to the point where the one $750 pledge could do a lot. Part of me is holding out hope for one last push for a stretch goal after this one... or that Rich will be super nice and make it a short one!</div> </div> </div> </div>They are already short ones - OPP lessen Stretch Goals from 15000$ to only 5000$. But maybe would be cool to get one free SG Era from all those that did not make in previous votings? Still, not seeing this happen, as we would need to have made DE 2 Companion only for 'begged' Era. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:54:11-07:00","id":1124930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124929#post1124929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They are already short ones - OPP lessen Stretch Goals from 15000$ to only 5000$. But maybe would be cool to get one free SG Era from all those that did not make in previous votings? Still, not seeing this happen, as we would need to have made DE 2 Companion only for 'begged' Era. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What do you mean? When we hit this goal, the main book is full. There are still the two Creator of Darkness and one Master Creator of Darkness pledges, so there will be at least three eras in the companion.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124926#post1124926\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Love to see some pre-Ordo Dracul faction from vampires and mages that will lay works for the Dracul to expand upon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And yes, really wanting to see Awakened alchemist of Islam and redefination of Assasin's, in light of Diamond vs Seers conflict.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair warning, our visions for the Ismailis are likely radically different. I have little desire to retread the plot Assassin's Creed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T13:56:04-07:00","id":1124931,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I see Arthurian era to be definitely a Mage/Changeling era and, if you consider the existence and fight against mythical monsters, I can concievably think of Hunter and even Beast (in somewhat antagonistic role) to fit the theme. On the other hand, I am not so sure about Demon. It's at its core a &quot;game of gnostic espionage&quot; and even if you could try to stuff it into the era, I don't think that the Angels, God-Machine and cogs everywhere quite fit the mood of the Arthurian stories, romance, myths and magic...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T14:00:05-07:00","id":1124933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124930#post1124930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you mean? When we hit this goal, the main book is full. There are still the two Creator of Darkness and one Master Creator of Darkness pledges, so there will be at least three eras in the companion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those are 'write for me this Era I conceived in my mind' rewards, yes? So 3 totally new, unknown for now Eras from fans?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T14:32:55-07:00","id":1124948,"title":"","content":"For those wondering &quot;why Hawara?&quot; Monica has some answers for you: <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/chronicles-of-darkness-dark-eras-2/posts/1955460?ref=backer_project_update\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...project_update</a><br /> <br /> ***Obligatory begging for someone to pick up the $750 pledge***","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T14:43:44-07:00","id":1124954,"title":"","content":"I was really hoping that <b>Steam Boats</b> would have won. I would have backed then.<br /> <br /> Is there any chance that high-level backers will bring it in?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T14:59:39-07:00","id":1124962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124954#post1124954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was really hoping that <b>Steam Boats</b> would have won. I would have backed then.<br /> <br /> Is there any chance that high-level backers will bring it in?</div> </div> </div> </div>No idea, as those backers remain anonymous.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T15:32:25-07:00","id":1124974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124809#post1124809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So here are some expansions on those. I haven't written up the Arthurian one yet since we don't know the games, but suffice to say, Fate Arcana/Pacts/Pledgecrafting would be central to it. Bonus points for being a late Roman era, since the Romans always took their oaths super seriously.<br /> <br /> <b>French Revolution</b> (VtR/MtC/DtD)<br /> In this era, immortal, ancient, and inhuman beings stalk the streets driven by all too human conflict. Vampires and Mummies are both ancient, relying on old, conservative power structures... until they start to crumble. How do these undead immortals relate to each other? What is the relationship between the forces that sustain them, Sekhem and Vitae? In the upheaval of the Revolution, both Demons and the God-Machine take advantage of the chaos to alter and twist Infrastructure, but these alterations are not taken kindly by the geometrically-inclined Arisen. The God-Machine may be an ancient and unknowable horror, but so are the Judges and the Mummies themselves as they strike out from their fortress in Louvre palace. It is up to the Unchained whether they should trust this enemy of their enemy... or whether this is just more competition. Does the Aether that Infrastructure generates have any relation to the Lifeweb of the Mummies? Can Infrastructure influence the channeling of Heka? Do Demons stand to gain anything from Relic Architecture and the Tombs of Mummies?<br /> <br /> <b>Great War</b> (WtF/PtC/GtSE)<br /> Promethean walk the land and new lineage is born out of the gas attacks, starting at Ypres, but they are not the only Created to create Wastelands in no man's lands. The Ulgan across France, Belgium, and Germany can sense the turmoil that the spirits are in because of the war and urge every throng they cross to come to the aid of the Werewolves desperately trying to keep them in check, even if that means crossing into the Shadow. Meanwhile, Prometheans well on their pilgrimage feel stirrings from the Underworld, and feel compelled to journey physically to the Rivers of Death to investigate, even as Sin-Eaters do the same. As the Created journey farther afield into the supernatural realms, they find the Shadow and Underworld roiling in unexpected ways, and must learn how to interact with ghosts, spirits, and cthonians... and how their disquiet impacts each one. <br /> <br /> <b>Seven Wonders</b> (PtC/CtL/MtC)<br /> As Promethens, Mummies, and Changelings are all drawn towards the greatest monuments of their times, they all ask themselves how did they get here? Mummies say that it was Fate, somehow intoning it so solemnly, you know that the first letter is a capital. Changelings say that it was the Wyrd, and the stories-oathes bound within. Prometheans say it was the Principle, and that their Pilgrimage demands it. How do the Wyrd, the Principle, and Fate relate to each other? Are they reflections of one another viewed from different lenses, or are they separate forces working at cross-purposes? Does the power of Azoth relate at all to life-giving Sekhem? Could a mummy eat away at the Divine Fire, or will they be burned from within? And is there some fundamental connection between the Glamour that Changelings harvest and the Pillars that keep Mummies standing?<br /> <br /> <b>1001 Nights</b> (VtR/MtA/BtP)<br /> It is a time of fables, stories, and high adventure! It is also a time of science, discovery, and exploration! It is inevitable that the two would collide. In this age, Ibn Batuta travels to far off lands, bringing back stories of horrors and wonders from the edge of ten Muslim world. Ibn Sina, the great scientist in the East or West prior to the Renaissance, compiled the medical knowledge of China, India, Persia, and Greece using poetic verse. Vampires, Mages, and Beast all hunger for different things; blood, knowledge, and fear; but those goals overlap and interlock. Thyrusus and Moros Mages collaborate with Vampire scientists to study the properties Vitae and understand the Kindred's undead condition. Obrimos and Acanthus enjoy the Islamic Neoplatonic revitalization, applying the idea of ideal forms to stories, and working with Beasts to track the spread and changes of the 1001 Nights through the Astral Realms. From the Nizari Ismaili State the Mastigos Hassan-I-Sabah and Nizari Quhistani, watch as their people are slandered as drug addicts and hedonists, when really they are farmers and philosophers. With the Fatimids, Ayuubids, and Mongols pressing in on them, and Kindred infiltrating the Syrian stronghold Masayaf, they have better things to worry about than setting the record straight, allowing the Assassin Legends to take root.<br /> <br /> <b>Pirates</b> (MtA/HtV/GtSE)<br /> Pirates! What's worse than pirates? Monster pirates. The British started this whole mess with their privateers. Our Spanish compact will crush any pirate or privateer they meet on the high seas root out the heretics among them. The Mughal Emperor Aurangzeb commanded us to rid the Indian Ocean of this plague of thieves before he died. If the pirates traffic with ghostly jinn to avoid death, we will hunt them down again! Pirate witches come north from New York to hide their treasures and ghastly rites in Nova Scotia. We will see them tarred and feathered, hanging from the gallows! All of these self righteous Compacts are fools! Why do they think we built a Pirate Nation in Madagascar? Because society is corrupt with monsters. Our Conspiracy of monster hunting keeps us free. Look at the these other who say they hold the Vigil? The Council of Bones and the Lucifuge? The Ageis Kai Doru and the Mallius Malficarum? The Acheron Group? They all pervert themselves by using magic to hunt monsters. Witches can see the realms from which they draw their magic, and so turn it against them. On Madagascar, we made no such mistake. <br /> <br /> Right now I'm leading towards Mage 1001 Nights, but as always, I am open to suggestions, and may change my mind. Also, if other expansion backers are lurking here, you are welcome, nay encouraged, to steal what I've written for your own pitches.</div> </div> </div> </div>You have some awesome ideas here! Seeing them expanded makes it even harder to choose which of them would be my favorite. I guess if I were to rank them, I'd go with this order:<br /> 1. French Revolution Mummy<br /> 2. Western Front Promethean <br /> 3. Pirate Hunter<br /> 4. Seven Wonders Mummy<br /> 5. Arthurian Demon<br /> 6. 1001 Nights Mage<br /> <br /> I find myself wondering whether they'll reveal the game lines for the stretch goal eras after the KS, or whether they'll wait to choose them until after they see what the expanders choose. I'm actually torn over which I'd prefer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T15:39:42-07:00","id":1124976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124921#post1124921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm starting to get why its Vampire/Beast now, although I went into it expecting Changeling too. The funny thing is that I had put the Mage expansion entirely on the backburner a while ago since I didn't see what I wanted to do with Mage fitting with the 1001 Nights theme. I figured it out though when I realized that the theme centres around legends... and that one of the most tenacious myths to come out of the Golden Age was the Assassin Legends. Even though that's not part of the 1001 Nights proper, it still fits in. I also think that it would be neat to see some Vampire/Mage cooperation that lays part the groundwork for the Ordo Dracul to rise after this era, as well as find out what the Strix look like under Mage Sight. We will see though.<br /> <br /> $1901 to go. Sci-Fi back in the lead. Also, you know what would be an awesome triplet for that era as well? Werewolf/Promethean/Deviant. The Golden Age of Science Fiction allowed people to envision new possibilities, ideal worlds, and fears. What does that mean? New Spirits. Have fun in the Shadow, pups.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know its funny that out of all the lines the one I want to see the most in ancient times and loathe the most in modern times is WtF? Wolves feature heavily in a number of mythologies but always strike me as sort of stale in a twentieth century Era. <br /> <br /> The funny thing is that I love Twenty First century Werewolf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11320-gigaton-falcon-emu","name":"Gigaton-Falcon-Emu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"786"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T15:44:09-07:00","id":1124980,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1124974#post1124974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You have some awesome ideas here! Seeing them expanded makes it even harder to choose which of them would be my favorite. I guess if I were to rank them, I'd go with this order:<br /> 1. French Revolution Mummy<br /> 2. Western Front Promethean <br /> 3. Pirate Hunter<br /> 4. Seven Wonders Mummy<br /> 5. Arthurian Demon<br /> 6. 1001 Nights Mage<br /> <br /> I find myself wondering whether they'll reveal the game lines for the stretch goal eras after the KS, or whether they'll wait to choose them until after they see what the expanders choose. I'm actually torn over which I'd prefer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! We'll see. I like all of them for very, very different reasons. What I was really looking for was something interesting in the crossover rules in addition to an interesting crossover in the settings and themes. Hence questions like how do Fate, Wyrd, and the Principle interact? Or what does Vitae look like under Mage Sight.<br /> <br /> I don't know about the reveal. On one hand, knowing what the lines will be would open up new possibilities. On the other hand, it means I have more decisions to make and the gamelines will be less even. Either way though, it will be awesome!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T17:27:08-07:00","id":1125012,"title":"","content":"Gah! We just lost a second Dark Collaberator! We'd be almost there if we had both of those! That's really frustrating.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | 