oo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T21:59:04-07:00","id":1125096,"title":"","content":"We are at $58,729 now, so 1271$ in 11 hours - it's still doable, guys!<br /> <br /> As to Ireland - obviously I want for this to be Werewolf, as sequel to <i>Wolf &amp; Raven</i> - there is whole 'Vikings made there stronghold for their raids'. Interesting would be having Changeling as second part - Ireland are connected to Fae and very good would be to see wolves/changelings interactions and mechanics. My take on <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/867500-apocalypse-tribes-as-2e-lodges/page5\">Fianna as Lodge</a> comes to mind. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Vampire will already have like 2-3 Era, at least, but we will see.<br /> <br /> Have hope to see this setting from really selfish reasons as I run <i>Wolf &amp; Raven</i> Werewolf game right now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-05-2017, 01:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"h