" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-31T13:36:52-07:00","id":1223704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1223657#post1223657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">how long will we have to wait?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;When it's ready.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-31T21:32:51-07:00","id":1223832,"title":"","content":"Wild West - Mage/Changeling<br /> <br /> I loved the idea <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4418_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4418\" data-vbnamecard=\"4418\">tasti man LH</a> wrote in post #1036 of this thread.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Consider this: it's well known that the world of the Wild West depicted in popular media is a VERY inaccurate depiction of the time period. Aside from the flagrant racism from earliest depiction, the high noon duels and the outlaw posses that ravaged lone towns was not as common an occurrence as depicted. If anything, all the townspeople were well armed enough that they could shoot any outlaw gangs out of town.<br /> <br /> So in the world of CofD and in the context of Mage...what if that romanticized view was one great big Lie?<br /> <br /> What if Something happened during the &quot;Wild West&quot; time period that the mages of that time period wanted to cover up? That something happened far more serious then rampant lawlessness and genocide of an indigenous people, that they really don't want Sleepers to remember? That they're content to create a romantic, rosy look on the Wild West and the &quot;good ol' days&quot; that never existed to begin with? Would have happened that they so desperately wanted to hide?\u201d<br /> <br /> While reading this I was also reading &quot;UTC Is Enough for Everyone - Right&quot;: <a href=\"https://zachholman.com/talk/utc-is-enough-for-everyone-right\" target=\"_blank\">https://zachholman.com/talk/utc-is-e...everyone-right</a> .<br /> <br /> &quot;In what is the most bourgeoisie example of the most bourgeoisie era, a bunch of rich, white railroad tycoons met at a fancy Chicago hotel to agree on a standard timezone so their trains would work better together. They used the new-fangled telegraph to synchronize time signals between cities.<br /> Other countries would do the same thing around this era. Previously, it was basically a free for all as to what time it would be in any given city:&quot;<br /> <br /> A great work that affected all Time magic and hid the era as well? <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12820-mythicjustice","name":"MythicJustice","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-31T21:40:54-07:00","id":1223833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Azahul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1221394#post1221394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rural Australia is a setting I've been carefully saving for the second edition of Mummy to come out for exactly this reason. It's so perfectly evocative.<br /> <br /> Besides, it just <i>fits</i> with Mummy so well. There's a sense of timelessness you get with the deep outback, and it's a land (and people) that makes Irem look young.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I agree so strongly. Add Beast and I'd be a super happy Outback camper!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","u