.com/mps2/c/4QA/6TYCAA/t.2ye/VuzqN3QqQXO4AB3apua_vQ/h4/HiipufzVan83Hryn5Mh8UTScPiJuC3dI-2FQdVJvV1jO-2BEr4qM0fkQty-2FOfQU8MEtd/xeOp\" target=\"_blank\">https://forms.gle/ASAWNb7M2A5RdJvp7</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-14T12:58:05-08:00","id":1360931,"title":"","content":"Hm. Before we begin, I just need to spit out a reference here:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hunger in the Black Land</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Magic and nature are one and the same, and the gods\u2019 servants walk the world. The Code the hunters of Kemet follow makes allowances for divine messengers, up until the point when these messengers fall to isfet; once they do, all bets are off, as many hunters of this era view themselves as Ma\u2019at\u2019s agents. Others are heretics who believe the gods ought to stay in the Duat where they belong and leave the Black Land to humanity. These <i>Mesha-Shentu</i>, or Soldiers of Blasphemy, form a compact dedicated to cursing anything openly supernatural to damnation, accepting their own exile from starry A\u2019aru in exchange for a Black Land where humanity is no longer ruled by pharaohs and greedy cultists.</div> </div> </div> </div>Rumor is that the Soldiers survive to the modern day, and are now under the leadership of a white-haired, formerly brunette, German Deviant with a large axe, and her creepy mage butler.<br /> <br /> I have only known these guys for a paragraph and I already love them. It's just that right mix of humanitarian and chutzpah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-14T13:28:31-08:00","id":1360938,"title":"","content":"There is so much new stuff in this book it looks amazing<br /> <br /> And yet I cannot get past WERECROCODILES","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-14T13:33:14-08:00","id":1360940,"title":"","content":"Will pre-ordering the book on backerkit get me access to the backer pdf or will I just have to wait until it comes out on drivethrurpg?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-14T13:34:11-