--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">hmmm i am curious as the entity called the Bloodless was left out in the end product :O no stats or anythingz.<br /> <br /> Ohhhh and a question....The Sobeki were written to be playable...right? Cuz &lt;.&lt; when you make a new changing breed expect em to be played. Now, them having integrity seems problematic...like that should plummet pretty fast</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not in their current form, I don't think. They're not even true werecreatures, they're the results of Death Wolf's nutcase ghostly doppleganger tricking a bunch of corrupt priests into being avatars of her paw-puppet. They're closer to Hosts than Uratha.<br /> <br /> That being said, I can see a rebel minority of them catching on and then manipulating the hunger so they aren't as cannibal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T06:14:41-08:00","id":1361263,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caedus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1361240#post1361240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Pos