s:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-19T19:57:23-08:00","id":1369088,"title":"","content":"Somehow, I forgot to finish reading Fear and the Golden Promise of Tomorrow. A lot of neat stuff here, though I am unsure what exactly the Platonic Body Variation is. It doesn't show up anywhere else in the book outside a handful of references to the power in this chapter, and the word &quot;Platonic&quot; occurs a total of 0 times in the Deviant core manuscript. A future teaser of the Clades Companion, perhaps?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-19T21:30:21-08:00","id":1369093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1369088#post1369088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Somehow, I forgot to finish reading Fear and the Golden Promise of Tomorrow. A lot of neat stuff here, though I am unsure what exactly the Platonic Body Variation is. It doesn't show up anywhere else in the book outside a handful of references to the power in this chapter, and the word &quot;Platonic&quot; occurs a total of 0 times in the Deviant core manuscript. A future teaser of the Clades Companion, perhaps?</div> </div> </div> </div>A Variation that got renamed to Rapid Healing, actually. In an early draft, it was a Coactive Variation, the idea being that you had a perfect and inviolable body that constantly worked toward restoring its own perfection. As the thematic elements of each Clade's Variations gelled, a few of them got moved around, and Platonic Body ended up as a Mutant Variation. The &quot;camera shutter&quot; opened at that moment, and the final drafts of Dark Eras 2 got turned in. Then, reviewing the names, Platonic Body didn't sound much like a Mutant Variation, so I renamed it more descriptively as Rapid Healing. By the time of the Deviant Kickstarter, the name change was complete, but Dark Eras 2 hadn't been placed in my hands again, yet, so it still had the old Variation name. It has since been corrected.<br /> <br /> The other mysterious Variation in Dark Eras 2 is Natural Weapon, which was originally the Brawl/Weaponry attack power. Because it and Lash were very long and had about 80% overlap, I ended up folding Natural Weapon into Lash, but a sample character in Light of the Sun had Natural Weapon at the time Dark Eras 2 went into editing. Also, the trick of &quot;naming&quot; each Lash effect for easy reference in a stat block didn't exist at the time, so you might notice their absence (or that the numbers don't quite line up, in places where small mechanical adjustments were made to Lash after DE2 finals were turned in). All that was corrected, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-28T23:00:12-08:00","id":1371196,"title":"","content":"Behind the curve as I ever am (my life is a hellscape of things to do), I gotta say I do appreciate Mali's interplay of Hunter and Demon, most particularly in how hunters <i>do</i> fuck around with the third place winner for most-powerful mainline splat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T23:12:22-07:00","id":1374713,"title":"","content":"Couldn't find anything about the Refrain via a search. Re: the Refrain in 1,001 Nightmares and beasts.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Refrain requires a human host to anchor it, giving her constant nightmares, and ends when that human dies. It has two effects for Beasts&quot; and then details Campfire Tales and Immortal Horror, but it isn't clear how it relates to the Refrain.<br /> <br /> 1. The Refrain is active on the Beast, which allows him to do the scary stories to feed.<br /> 2. The audience is someone who has the Refrain, which allows him to do the scary stories on him.<br /> 3. The Refrain is active on someone, somewhere on the planet, which allows all beasts everywhere to do scary stories to feed.<br /> 4. People catch the Refrain by having scary stories told to them.<br /> <br /> I kind of assumed #1, but I'm not sure if beasts are human.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T02:39:49-07:00","id":1374728,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deinos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1374713#post1374713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Couldn't find anything about the Refrain via a search. Re: the Refrain in 1,001 Nightmares and beasts.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Refrain requires a human host to anchor it, giving her constant nightmares, and ends when that human dies. It has two effects for Beasts&quot; and then details Campfire Tales and Immortal Horror, but it isn't clear how it relates to the Refrain.<br /> <br /> 1. The Refrain is active on the Beast, which allows him to do the scary stories to feed.<br /> 2. The audience is someone who has the Refrain, which allows him to do the scary stories on him.<br /> 3. The Refrain is active on someone, somewhere on the planet, which allows all beasts everywhere to do scary stories to feed.<br /> 4. People catch the Refrain by having scary stories told to them.<br /> <br /> I kind of assumed #1, but I'm not sure if beasts are human.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm inclined to say #4 is closest. It doesn't 'catch' so much as 'marks' the locals as 'legimate' listeners...<br /> Actually, I'd say it might effect the Hive, rather humans and Begotten. It is unclear, but that just means when the Refrain comes to town, the Brood has a mystery to solve.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T08:11:50-07:00","id":1374759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1100689-dark-eras-2-discussion-thread?p=1374728#post1374728\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm inclined to say #4 is closest. It doesn't 'catch' so much as 'marks' the locals as 'legimate' listeners...<br /> Actually, I'd say it might effect the Hive, rather humans and Begotten. It is unclear, but that just means when the Refrain comes to town, the Brood has a mystery to solve.</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct, great idea, and absolutely!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-17T09:05:59-07:00","id":1375286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m